window.SALON_PRODUCTS = [{"id":6918,"name":"ASPECT AGE MANAGEMENT KIT","brand":"Aspect","price":290,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Age-Management-Kit-Aspect-Salon-One-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Age Management Kit\nProvides visible improvement in skin hydration and brightness while addressing concerns associated with poor skin texture and elasticity. Aspect Age Management Kit also supplies skin with multiple forms of antioxidant protection; an essential in every effective anti-ageing regime.\n\nKit Benefits\n\nFour key anti-ageing products\nEnhanced skin hydration and barrier function\nAntioxidant protection\n\nIKit includes: Purastat 5 30ml, Retinol Brulee 30ml, Extreme C20 30ml, Phytostat 9 15g\n\nRetinol Brulee is not recommended for pregnant or lactating women"},{"id":11470,"name":"ASPECT CLEAR SKIN COMPLEX","brand":"Aspect","price":98,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Clear-Skin-Complex-50g-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Clear Skin Complex 50g\nTarget common concerns associated with problematic skin, including blemishes and excess oil for a clear, more radiant looking complexion.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nClarifies complexion\nReduces the appearance of skin imperfections associated with problematic skin.\n\nSuitable for:\n\nOily / Problematic"},{"id":6920,"name":"ASPECT CLEAR SKIN KIT","brand":"Aspect","price":110,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Clear-Skin-Kit-Salon-One.jpg","description":"Aspect Clear Skin Kit\nAddress problematic skin with this collection formulated to help purify for a clearer looking skin.\n\nReduces the appearance of skin imperfections associated with problematic skin.\nMattifying and balancing\nAntioxidant support\n\nKit Includes:\n\nClear Skin Exfoliating Prep 100ml\nClear Skin Cleanser 100ml\nClean Skin Lotion 50ml\nStop Spot 8ml\n\nNot Recommended for Pregnant or Lactating Women"},{"id":6964,"name":"ASPECT EXFOL L","brand":"Aspect","price":100,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Exfol-L-30ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Exfol L\nA lightweight exfoliating serum containing AHA’s to help smooth skin and prepare for application of active ingredients.\n\nSuitable all skin including:Ageing, Pigmentation and Oily / Problematic\n\nBenefits include:\n\nRefining\nExfoliating\nAntioxidant\nSoothing and calming"},{"id":6970,"name":"ASPECT EXTREME B17","brand":"Aspect","price":146,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Extreme-B-17-30ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"A powerhouse serum formulated with B vitamins to help prevent dehydration, even out skin tone and balance excess oil. Skin appears plump and more youthful.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nVitamin B3 to nurture stressed skin and aid in skin recovery.\nCalming and soothing properties.\nAntioxidant\nHydrating\n\nSuitable for all skin types,"},{"id":6974,"name":"ASPECT EXTREME C20","brand":"Aspect","price":146,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Extreme-C-20-30ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Extreme C 20 30ml\nA powerful antioxidant serum containing Vitamin C and peptides to help promote skin elasticity and illuminate appearance.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nCalming\nHelps reduce flushing\nHelps to illuminate and protect skin.\n\nSuitable for all skin types including:\n\nAgeing\nPigmentation\nOily / Problematic\nDry"},{"id":6933,"name":"ASPECT EYELIFT 3 15g","brand":"Aspect","price":146,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Eyelift-3-15g-2000x2000-1-e1645527666498.jpg","description":"Aspect Eyelift 3\n\nThe remarkable effectiveness of the key active in Eyelift 3 was demonstrated in a 56 day long clinical study and confirmed by detailed scientific image analysis. Here is what the researchers found:\n\nDark under eye circles: visibly reduced by 35%\nUnder eye puffiness: visibly reduced by 31%\nSmoothness and skin texture: 42% smoother"},{"id":6977,"name":"ASPECT GENTLE CLEANSER 100ML","brand":"Aspect","price":66,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Gentle-Clean-100ml-2000x2000-1-e1591550916784.jpg","description":"Aspect Gentle Cleanser\nCleanse and remove makeup with this gentle gel foaming cleanser. Hydrating and nurturing.\n\nSuitable for even the most sensitive skin.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nEffectively cleanses the skin\nSuitable for post- procedure skin\nEffective makeup remover"},{"id":6925,"name":"ASPECT HYDRATING MASK","brand":"Aspect","price":75,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hrydratingmaskresized1.jpg","description":"Aspect Hydrating Mask\n\nApply this beautiful mask to give your skin a boost of hydration. This is a non-setting mask that leaves your skin feeling refreshed. Great for a night treatment. Apply a sparing amount and leave on or apply a generous amount, leave for 10-15 minutes then rinse off."},{"id":11443,"name":"ASPECT Illuminating Polish 220ml","brand":"Aspect","price":75,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Illuminating-Polish-220ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Illuminating Polish 220ml\nA triple-action exfoliant that combines Ecoscrub, enzymes and AHA’s to gently polish, removing lifeless cells.\n\nSkin instantly feels smoother and appears more radiant.\n\nSuitable all skin including: Ageing, Pigmentation and Oily / Problematic\n\nBenefits include:\n\nGently polishes skin surface to remove lifeless cells.\nAn AHA that helps to refine and exfoliate.\nRich in antioxidants.\nMoisturises and smooths skin texture."},{"id":6966,"name":"ASPECT JUNGLE BREW","brand":"Aspect","price":145,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Jungle-Brew-30ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Jungle Brew® 30ml\nProblematic skin serum\nPurify problematic skin and target concerns including excess oil and imperfections. Lightweight texture allows for rapid absorption to help minimise shine.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nPurifying\nMattifying\nSoothing and calming\nAntioxidant\n\nSuitable for all skin types:\n\nOily / Problematic\nSensitive"},{"id":12500,"name":"Aspect Minerals Kabuki Brush","brand":"Aspect","price":36,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Minerals_Kabuki-Brush_2000x2000-e1616709533695.jpg","description":"The perfect companion for your Aspect Minerals™ product, this Kabuki brush features soft, thick bristles for flawless product application."},{"id":12520,"name":"Aspect Minerals Primer 28ml","brand":"Aspect","price":56,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Minerals_Primer_2000x2000-e1617239357217.jpg","description":"Create the perfect canvas for even and smooth coverage with the Aspect Minerals Primer formulated with Vitamin E and the Aspect Signature Blend of skin-loving Australian botanicals."},{"id":6931,"name":"ASPECT PHYTOSTAT 9 50g","brand":"Aspect","price":99,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Phytostat-9-50g-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Phytostat 9 50g\n4 in 1 moisturiser – Deliver a surge of hydration to reveal smoother more vibrant looking skin with this every day, go-to moisturiser.."},{"id":6968,"name":"ASPECT PIGMENT PUNCH","brand":"Aspect","price":165,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Pigment-Punch-30ml-2000x2000-2.jpg","description":"Aspect Pigment Punch 30ml\nEven Skin Serum, apply morning and night onto cleansed skin.\n\nA naturally lighter and brighter future for your complexion. Clarifies and brightens the appearance of age spots and discolourations.\nSuitable for\n\nPigmentation\nAgeing"},{"id":11471,"name":"ASPECT PIGMENT PUNCH +","brand":"Aspect","price":158,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Pigment-Punch-30ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Address and help prevent the appearance of age spots and pigmented areas to illuminate and even out skin tone.\n\nAspect Pigment Punch   30ml\n\nBenefits include:\n\nHelps illuminate and even out complexion.\nAntioxidant properties\n\nSuitable for skin types:\n\nPigmentation\nAgeing"},{"id":11441,"name":"ASPECT PURASTAT 5 Cleanser 100ml","brand":"Aspect","price":37,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Purastat-5-Cleanser-100ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Purastat 5 Cleanser 100ml\nA gentle exfoliating foaming cleanser that thoroughly frees skin of embedded dirt, makeup, excess oil and environmental pollutants without stripping the skin. Suitable for all skin including Oily and Problematic skin types.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nGently cleanses and exfoliates\nNon-irritant formulation\nEffective makeup remove"},{"id":6914,"name":"ASPECT PURASTAT 5 Cleanser 220ml","brand":"Aspect","price":67,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Purastat-5-Cleanser-220ml-2000x2000-1-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Purastat 5 Cleanser 220ml\nA gentle exfoliating foaming cleanser that thoroughly frees skin of embedded dirt, makeup, excess oil and environmental pollutants without stripping the skin. Suitable for all skin including Oily and Problematic skin types.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nGently cleanses and exfoliates\nNon-irritant formulation\nEffective makeup remove"},{"id":6935,"name":"ASPECT RED-LESS 21","brand":"Aspect","price":146,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/redless21resized1.jpg","description":"Sea Buckthorn Serum, apply morning and night onto cleansed skin.\n\nRelaxation therapy in a bottle for skin on the verge of a nervous breakdown!\n\nFacial redness? Skin sensitivity? Chronically dry skin? Uncontrollable blushing? Uncomfortably tight skin? Rough flaky crocodile skin? Ruddiness? Lumps and bumps? React to spicy foods or alcohol/ React to fragrances, colours and preservatives? Feel like its on fire? Blotchy? Has a mind of its own? Looks older than it should? Unhealthy looking? Devitalised?\n\nThen this is for you!"},{"id":9856,"name":"ASPECT Red-Less 30ml","brand":"Aspect","price":143,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Red-Less-21-30ml-2000x2000-1-e1645527100565.jpg","description":"Sea Buckthorn anti-red & antioxidant serum.\n\nCalming\nProtective barrier\nSoothing\nAntioxidant protection\nDetoxifying\n\nSUITABLE FOR:\n\nAll irritated skins, eczema, dermatitis, rosacea, burns – to provide protection post peel, laser, surgery.\n\nUSAGE:\n\nWhenever needed post water based serums. Small pea size warmed up in hands and applied to entire face. Not to be used on open wounds.\n\nSize 15mls"},{"id":6972,"name":"ASPECT RETINOL BRULEE","brand":"Aspect","price":141,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Retinol-Brulee-30ml-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Retinol Brulee 30ml\nA refining night serum containing Retinol. Helps to smooth and diminish the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, revealing more youthful-looking skin.\n\nAnti ageing\nHelps to retexturise and smooth skin.\nRich in vitamins and amino acids.\n\nSuitable for all skin type including:\n\nAgeing\nOily / Problematic\nDry\nSensitive\n\nNot Recommended for Pregnant or Lactating Women"},{"id":14944,"name":"Aspect Retinol LGS","brand":"Aspect","price":90,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Retinol-LGS-15g-2000x2000-1-e1662685871581.jpg","description":"A powerful multifunctional Vitamin A that delivers radical benefit to ageing and sun-damaged skin. Retinol LGS  contains a complex concentration of Vitamin A, plus the added benefits of triple acids, making it an Age-Defying treatment that deeply exfoliates dull, aging, uneven, problematic skin for a softer, smoother appearance.\n\nThis powerful night-time treatment is infused with probiotics, plus Aspect’s Signature Blend of skin-loving Australian botanicals to revitalise and nourish skin for a glowing refreshed appearance.\n\nRetinol LGS  is perfect for those who use retinol skincare, seeking to level up to move up to a stronger product, or as a peel-preparation treatment."},{"id":13618,"name":"Aspect Retinol LGS","brand":"Aspect","price":90,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Retinol-LGS-15g-2000x2000-1-e1662685871581.jpg","description":"A powerful multifunctional Vitamin A that delivers radical benefit to ageing and sun-damaged skin. Retinol LGS  contains a complex concentration of Vitamin A, plus the added benefits of triple acids, making it an Age-Defying treatment that deeply exfoliates dull, aging, uneven, problematic skin for a softer, smoother appearance.\n\nThis powerful night-time treatment is infused with probiotics, plus Aspect’s Signature Blend of skin-loving Australian botanicals to revitalise and nourish skin for a glowing refreshed appearance.\n\nRetinol LGS  is perfect for those who use retinol skincare, seeking to level up to move up to a stronger product, or as a peel-preparation treatment."},{"id":6916,"name":"ASPECT SOOTHING KIT","brand":"Aspect","price":176,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Soothing-Kit-Aspect-Salon-One.jpg","description":"3 key products that work in harmony to soothe, calm and enrich sensitised skin, the Post Treatment Kit serves as a non-irritating and complete skincare system. Simply start by cleansing gently, before moving on to a barrier-protecting serum and finishing with an antioxidant-enriched hydration boost. Suitable for all skin types including sensitive skin.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nSoothing and calming\nBarrier protection support\nHydrating\n\nKit Includes: Gentle Cleanser 30ml, Hydrating Serum 15ml, Redless 21 15ml"},{"id":6923,"name":"ASPECT STARTER KIT","brand":"Aspect","price":156,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Starter-Kit-Aspect-Salon-One.jpg","description":"Aspect Starter Kit\nKick start your Aspect skin journey with a collection of hero products.\n\nStarter kit includes: Purastat 5 30ml, Extreme C20 15ml, Exfol L 15ml, Phytostat 9 15g"},{"id":6981,"name":"ASPECT SUPER MOISTURISING COMPLEX","brand":"Aspect","price":98,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Aspect-Super-Moisturising-Complex-50g-2000x2000-1.jpg","description":"Aspect Super Moisturising Complex 50g\nA luxuriously rich moisturising cream formulated to help plump the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\n\nBenefits include:\n\nHelps smooth the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\nContains an antioxidant that helps to protect from external free radicals.\n\nSuitable for:\n\nAll skin\nDry"},{"id":7947,"name":"ASPECT TRY ME KIT","brand":"Aspect","price":59.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Try-Me-Kit-Aspect-Salon-One.jpg","description":"Aspect Try Me Kit\nTry some of the best sellers from the Aspect range with this fab Try Me Kit, suitable for all skin types.\n\nIdeal way to start on Aspect products\n\nPerfect travel size\n\nAbility to assess clients for tolerance of the products\n\nContains: Purastat 5 7ml, Extreme C20 7ml, Extreme B17 7ml, Phytostat 15g"},{"id":16274,"name":"Eimi Bold Move","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/EIMI-Bold-Move.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Bold Move\n\nCreate effortless, textured styles with Wella Professionals EIMI Bold Move, a lightweight matte styling paste designed to provide flexible hold, definition, and a natural finish.\n\nPerfect for creating modern, undone looks, Bold Move helps add texture and separation while keeping hair soft and touchable. Its workable formula allows you to shape, mould, and restyle your hair throughout the day without stiffness or a heavy product feel.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides flexible hold and control\n\nCreates natural texture and definition\n\nDelivers a soft matte finish\n\nAllows easy reshaping and restyling\n\nAdds separation and movement\n\nLeaves hair feeling touchable and lightweight\n\nHow to Use:\n\nWarm a small amount between your hands and apply through dry hair. Work through the lengths and ends, shaping and defining your style as desired."},{"id":16275,"name":"Eimi Boost Bounce","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/NUTRICURLS_EIMI_Boost_Bounce-.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Boost Bounce\n\nEnhance your natural curls and waves with Wella Professionals EIMI Boost Bounce, a lightweight curl-enhancing mousse designed to create soft, bouncy curls with beautiful definition and movement.\n\nPerfect for curly and wavy hair types, Boost Bounce helps reduce frizz while adding moisture, flexibility, and shine. This nourishing formula supports natural curl shape while leaving hair feeling soft, touchable, and full of life without crunch or stiffness.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nEnhances and defines curls and waves\n\nAdds bounce, body, and movement\n\nHelps reduce frizz and flyaways\n\nProvides flexible hold\n\nLeaves curls soft and touchable\n\nHelps maintain natural curl shape\n\nHow to Use:\n\nShake well and dispense into your hands. Apply evenly through damp hair, scrunching curls from the ends upwards. Allow to air dry or diffuse for enhanced volume and definition."},{"id":16276,"name":"Eimi Curl Shaper","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/NUTRICURLS_EIMI_Curls_Shaper.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Curl Shaper\n\nDefine and enhance your natural curls with Wella Professionals EIMI Curl Shaper, a lightweight curl styling cream designed to create beautifully shaped, flexible curls while helping to control frizz.\n\nPerfect for curly and wavy hair, Curl Shaper helps improve curl definition and movement while maintaining a soft, touchable finish. Its flexible formula supports natural curl patterns, leaving hair feeling smooth, hydrated, and full of bounce.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nEnhances and defines curls\n\nProvides flexible hold and control\n\nHelps reduce frizz and flyaways\n\nMaintains natural curl movement\n\nLeaves curls soft and touchable\n\nCreates a smooth, polished finish\n\nHow to Use:\n\nApply a small amount through damp hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Shape curls with your fingers, scrunch, or diffuse to enhance definition and movement."},{"id":16273,"name":"Eimi Dry Me Dry Shampoo","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_Dry_Me_200ml.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Dry Me\n\nRefresh and transform your style with Wella Professionals EIMI Dry Me, a lightweight dry shampoo spray designed to absorb excess oil, add texture, and create natural-looking volume between washes.\n\nPerfect for refreshing second-day hair, Dry Me helps revive your style while creating a soft, matte finish with added grip and body. Its lightweight formula leaves hair feeling refreshed and manageable, making it ideal for adding texture to everyday looks.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nAbsorbs excess oil and refreshes hair\n\nAdds lightweight volume and texture\n\nCreates a soft matte finish\n\nHelps extend styles between washes\n\nProvides grip for easier styling\n\nLeaves hair feeling fresh and touchable\n\nHow to Use:\n\nShake well before use. Spray evenly onto dry hair, focusing on the roots and areas needing refreshment. Massage through with fingertips or brush out, then style as desired."},{"id":16277,"name":"Eimi Extra Volume Mousse","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/EIMI_Extra-Volume_Mousse_500ml.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Extra Volume Mousse\n\nCreate lasting volume and body with Wella Professionals EIMI Extra Volume Mousse, a professional styling mousse designed to enhance fullness while providing strong, flexible hold.\n\nPerfect for creating voluminous blow-dries and fuller-looking styles, Extra Volume Mousse helps lift the roots, add texture, and maintain movement without leaving hair feeling heavy or sticky. Its lightweight formula helps protect hair during heat styling while delivering a smooth, salon-finished result.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides long-lasting volume and body\n\nStrong yet flexible hold\n\nHelps create fuller-looking styles\n\nSupports blow-drying and heat styling\n\nLeaves hair smooth and touchable\n\nHelps protect hair during styling\n\nHow to Use:\n\nShake well and dispense a small amount into your palm. Apply evenly through damp hair, focusing on the roots and mid-lengths. Blow-dry and style as desired for maximum volume and movement."},{"id":16278,"name":"Eimi Flowing Form","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_-Flowing-_form.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Flowing Form\n\nCreate smooth, controlled styles with Wella Professionals EIMI Flowing Form, a lightweight smoothing balm designed to reduce frizz, enhance softness, and create a beautifully polished finish.\n\nPerfect for blow-dries and smooth, flowing hairstyles, Flowing Form helps protect hair from heat styling while providing flexible control and natural movement. This nourishing formula leaves hair feeling silky, manageable, and touchable without weighing it down.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nSmooths and controls frizz\n\nCreates a sleek, polished finish\n\nProvides flexible hold and movement\n\nHelps protect hair from heat styling\n\nAdds softness and shine\n\nLeaves hair feeling smooth and manageable\n\nHow to Use:\n\nApply a small amount through damp hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Blow-dry with a brush for a smooth finish or style as desired."},{"id":16279,"name":"Eimi Fresh Up","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/NUTRICURLS_EIMI_Fresh_Up-.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Fresh Up\n\nRefresh and revive your style with Wella Professionals EIMI Fresh Up, a lightweight finishing spray designed to instantly refresh hair while providing flexible hold and natural movement.\n\nPerfect for extending the life of your hairstyle between washes, Fresh Up helps absorb excess oil, reduce unwanted shine, and bring back volume and texture. Its lightweight formula leaves hair feeling refreshed, touchable, and full of movement without build-up or stiffness.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nRefreshes hair between washes\n\nHelps absorb excess oil\n\nAdds lightweight texture and volume\n\nProvides flexible, natural-looking hold\n\nHelps revive second-day styles\n\nLeaves hair feeling fresh and manageable\n\nHow to Use:\n\nShake well before use. Spray lightly onto dry hair, focusing on the roots and areas needing refreshment. Massage or brush through, then style as desired."},{"id":16271,"name":"Eimi Glam Mist","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/EIMI_GLAM_MIST_200ML.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Glam Mist\n\nAdd a touch of glamour to your style with Wella Professionals EIMI Glam Mist, a lightweight shine spray designed to enhance your hair’s natural radiance while providing a smooth, polished finish.\n\nPerfect for finishing any look, Glam Mist helps create beautiful shine, smoothness, and softness without leaving hair feeling heavy or greasy. Ideal for special occasions or everyday styling, it gives hair a luxurious, glossy finish.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nAdds instant shine and luminosity\n\nCreates a smooth, polished finish\n\nHelps tame flyaways\n\nLightweight, non-greasy formula\n\nLeaves hair feeling soft and silky\n\nPerfect for finishing and enhancing styles\n\nHow to Use:\n\nSpray lightly onto dry hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Use as a finishing touch to enhance shine and create a beautiful glossy result."},{"id":16280,"name":"Eimi Grip Cream","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_-Grip_Cream.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Grip Cream\n\nCreate defined, textured styles with Wella Professionals EIMI Grip Cream, a versatile styling cream that provides flexible hold, separation, and natural-looking definition.\n\nIdeal for creating modern, effortless styles, Grip Cream helps shape and control hair while maintaining a soft, touchable finish. This workable formula allows you to mould and reshape your style throughout the day without leaving hair feeling heavy or sticky.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides flexible hold and control\n\nAdds texture and definition\n\nCreates separation and movement\n\nHelps tame flyaways\n\nAllows for restyling throughout the day\n\nLeaves hair with a natural, touchable finish\n\nHow to Use:\n\nWarm a small amount between your hands and work evenly through dry hair. Shape, define, and style as desired. Add more product if extra control or texture is needed."},{"id":16281,"name":"Eimi Just Brilliant","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_Just_Brilliant_75ml.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Just Brilliant\n\nAdd smoothness, shine, and polished definition with Wella Professionals EIMI Just Brilliant, a lightweight finishing pomade designed to create sleek, refined styles with a beautiful glossy finish.\n\nPerfect for smoothing flyaways, enhancing texture, and adding a touch of shine, Just Brilliant helps create a professional finish while keeping hair feeling soft and manageable. Its lightweight formula provides flexible control without leaving hair greasy or weighed down.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nAdds a beautiful glossy shine\n\nSmooths flyaways and frizz\n\nProvides lightweight control\n\nEnhances definition and texture\n\nLeaves hair soft and touchable\n\nIdeal for polished, sleek finishes\n\nHow to Use:\n\nWarm a small amount between your palms and apply through dry hair. Focus on mid-lengths and ends to smooth, define, and add shine. Style as desired."},{"id":16270,"name":"Eimi Mistify Me Light","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/cskamhz5/image/upload/w_600/v1788254443/EIMI_Mistify_Me_LIGHT.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Mistify Me Light\n\nFinish your style with lightweight hold and natural movement using Wella Professionals EIMI Mistify Me Light, a fine finishing spray designed to provide flexible control without weighing hair down.\n\nPerfect for everyday styling, this fast-drying hairspray helps keep your look in place while maintaining softness, bounce, and a touchable finish. Its lightweight formula allows you to brush through and restyle your hair easily, making it ideal for creating natural, effortless looks.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nLightweight, flexible hold\n\nFast-drying formula\n\nKeeps styles soft and touchable\n\nAllows natural movement and bounce\n\nEasy to brush out\n\nIdeal for everyday finishing\n\nHow to Use:\n\nSpray evenly onto dry hair from approximately 30cm away to finish your style. Layer for additional hold while maintaining a lightweight feel."},{"id":16269,"name":"Eimi Mistify Me Strong","brand":"EIMI","price":35,"image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/cskamhz5/image/upload/w_600/v1788254443/EIMI_Fixing_Hairspray_Mistify_Me_STRONG.jpg","description":"Fast-drying strong hold hairspray with micro-mist technology for flexible styling."},{"id":16282,"name":"Eimi Ocean Spritz","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_Ocean_Spritz_150ml.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Ocean Spritz\n\nCreate effortless, beach-inspired texture with Wella Professionals EIMI Ocean Spritz, a lightweight salt spray designed to enhance natural movement and create tousled, undone styles.\n\nPerfect for creating relaxed waves and a textured finish, Ocean Spritz adds body, grip, and definition while maintaining a soft, touchable feel. Inspired by the look of sun-kissed beach hair, this versatile spray helps create a naturally windswept style with flexible hold.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nCreates effortless beach waves and texture\n\nAdds body and natural-looking volume\n\nProvides lightweight grip and definition\n\nEnhances natural movement\n\nCreates a matte, tousled finish\n\nSuitable for all hair types\n\nHow to Use:\n\nSpray evenly through damp or dry hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Scrunch or twist sections to enhance texture and waves, then allow hair to air dry or use a diffuser for added movement."},{"id":16285,"name":"Eimi Pearl Styler","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/EIMI_Pearl-styler_30ml.jpg","description":"Create flexible, defined styles with Wella Professionals EIMI Pearl Styler, a versatile styling gel that provides texture, movement, and a beautiful pearlescent shine. Designed to enhance your style while maintaining a natural feel, this lightweight formula helps create modern looks with lasting definition.\n\nPerfect for adding separation, smoothing flyaways, or creating structured styles, Pearl Styler provides flexible hold without leaving hair feeling stiff or sticky. Ideal for short to medium-length hair, it allows you to reshape and restyle throughout the day.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides flexible hold and control\n\nAdds texture and definition\n\nCreates a pearlescent shine finish\n\nHelps smooth flyaways\n\nAllows for restyling and movement\n\nSuitable for a variety of hair textures and styles\n\nHow to Use:\n\nApply a small amount into the palms and work through damp or dry hair. Shape and style as desired, adding more product for extra definition and control."},{"id":16272,"name":"Eimi Root Shoot","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_Root_Shoot_150ml.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Root Shoot\n\nCreate instant root lift and long-lasting volume with Wella Professionals EIMI Root Shoot, a precision volumising mousse designed to add body and support directly at the roots.\n\nPerfect for creating fuller-looking styles and boosting fine or flat hair, Root Shoot provides targeted lift without leaving hair feeling stiff or weighed down. Its lightweight formula helps create natural movement, making it ideal for blow-dries and styles that need extra height and support.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides targeted root lift and volume\n\nHelps create fuller-looking hair\n\nLightweight formula with natural movement\n\nSupports blow-drying and styling\n\nHelps add body without stiffness\n\nIdeal for fine or limp hair types\n\nHow to Use:\n\nShake well and apply directly to the roots of damp hair. Use a brush and blow-dryer to lift and shape the hair, focusing on creating volume where desired."},{"id":16287,"name":"Eimi Rugged Texture","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_Rugged_Texture_75ml.jpg","description":"Create effortlessly textured, rugged styles with Wella Professionals EIMI Rugged Texture. This matte finish styling paste provides flexible hold and definition, allowing you to create natural-looking texture, separation, and movement without feeling heavy or sticky.\n\nPerfect for short to medium-length styles, this versatile product helps enhance your hair’s natural shape while giving a modern, lived-in finish. Whether you’re creating a messy, textured look or adding definition and control, Rugged Texture keeps your style flexible and touchable throughout the day.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nMatte finish for a natural look\n\nProvides texture and separation\n\nFlexible hold with a touchable feel\n\nHelps create effortless, undone styles\n\nIdeal for short to medium-length hair\n\nHow to Use:\n\nWarm a small amount between your hands and work through dry hair. Style and shape as desired, adding more product if needed for extra definition and texture."},{"id":16286,"name":"Eimi Shape Me","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_Shape_Me-scaled.jpg","description":"Wella EIMI Shape Me\n\nCreate long-lasting, flexible styles with Wella Professionals EIMI Shape Me, a heat-activated styling gel designed to help shape, define, and hold your look while protecting hair during heat styling.\n\nActivated by heat, this innovative formula helps maintain your hairstyle for up to 48 hours, while providing memory hold that allows your style to keep its shape. Perfect for blow-drying, adding volume, or creating smooth, polished finishes, Shape Me helps deliver a salon-quality result with lasting movement and control.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHeat-activated styling support\n\nHelps maintain styles for up to 48 hours\n\nProvides flexible memory hold\n\nHelps protect hair during heat styling\n\nCreates smooth, defined finishes\n\nLightweight formula with a natural feel\n\nHow to Use:\n\nApply a small amount evenly through damp hair. Blow-dry and style using your preferred tools to activate the formula and create your desired look."},{"id":16284,"name":"Eimi Soft Twirl","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/EIMI_Soft_Twirl-.jpg","description":"Create beautiful, defined curls and waves with Wella Professionals EIMI Soft Twirl, a lightweight curl styling cream designed to enhance natural movement while providing soft definition and flexible control.\n\nPerfect for curly and wavy hair types, Soft Twirl helps shape and define curls while reducing frizz and adding a touchable, natural finish. This versatile styling cream leaves hair feeling soft, smooth, and full of movement without stiffness or crunch.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nEnhances curls and waves\n\nProvides soft, flexible definition\n\nHelps control frizz and flyaways\n\nLeaves hair feeling smooth and touchable\n\nAdds natural movement and bounce\n\nLightweight formula suitable for everyday styling\n\nHow to Use:\n\nApply a small amount through damp hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Scrunch or shape curls as desired, then allow hair to air dry or diffuse for enhanced definition."},{"id":16283,"name":"Eimi Super Set","brand":"EIMI","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/EIMI_Super-Set_Hairspray_500ml.jpg","description":"Lock in your style with Wella Professionals EIMI Super Set, a strong-hold finishing spray designed to provide long-lasting control, definition, and shine. This professional hairspray helps secure your look while maintaining a natural feel and flexible movement.\n\nPerfect for finishing any style, Super Set provides reliable hold without leaving hair feeling stiff or weighed down. Its fast-drying formula helps protect against humidity and keeps your style looking polished and fresh throughout the day.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nStrong, long-lasting hold\n\nHelps protect against humidity\n\nFast-drying formula\n\nProvides natural-looking shine\n\nKeeps styles secure while allowing movement\n\nEasy to brush out\n\nHow to Use:\n\nHold the can approximately 30cm away from dry hair and spray evenly to finish your style. Layer for extra hold and control where needed."},{"id":16288,"name":"Eimi Thermal Image","brand":"EIMI","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Eimi_Thermal_image_150ml.jpg","description":"Thermal Image, a two-phase heat protection spray designed to shield hair from damage caused by hot tools while creating a smooth, polished finish.\n\nThis lightweight formula helps protect hair from temperatures of up to 220°C, reducing the effects of heat styling while helping to maintain softness, shine, and manageability. Perfect for clients who regularly use straighteners, curling irons, or blow-dryers, Thermal Image helps create beautiful, healthy-looking styles with every use.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProtects hair from heat damage up to 220°C\n\nHelps reduce dryness caused by heat styling\n\nCreates a smooth, glossy finish\n\nHelps control frizz and flyaways\n\nLightweight formula suitable for daily styling\n\nHow to Use:\n\nShake well before use. Spray evenly onto dry hair, section by section, before using heat styling tools. Style as desired and enjoy a smooth, protected finish."},{"id":17619,"name":"Hidehere Cica Care Cream","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/CICA-CARE-CREAM-9.webp","description":"Calm, nourish and protect your skin with the Hidehere Cica Care Cream — a soothing daily moisturiser designed to strengthen the skin’s natural barrier while delivering long-lasting hydration.\n\nEnriched with Cica (Centella Asiatica), this comforting cream helps reduce the appearance of redness, soothe sensitive or irritated skin, and replenish essential moisture. Its rich yet lightweight formula absorbs beautifully, leaving your skin feeling soft, balanced and comfortably hydrated without a greasy finish.\n\nPerfect for everyday use, the Hidehere Cica Care Cream helps support a healthier-looking complexion by protecting the skin from moisture loss while promoting a smooth, calm and radiant appearance.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nSensitive or easily irritated skin\n\nDry or dehydrated skin needing extra nourishment\n\nRedness-prone complexions\n\nStrengthening and maintaining the skin’s natural barrier\n\nHow to use:\n\nAs the final step in your skincare routine, apply an even layer to the face and neck after cleansing, toning and applying serum. Gently massage into the skin until fully absorbed. Use morning and evening for best results.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps soothe and calm sensitive skin\n\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes\n\nSupports and strengthens the skin barrier\n\nHelps reduce the appearance of redness\n\nLeaves skin feeling soft, smooth and comfortable\n\nSalon One Tip:\n\nFor skin that feels stressed or sensitised, pair the Hidehere Cica Care Cream with the Hidehere Cica Care Toner Emulsion to maximise hydration and comfort while helping restore a healthy, balanced complexion."},{"id":17615,"name":"Hidehere Cica Care Toner Emulsion","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/CICA-CARE-TONER-EMULSION-5.webp","description":"Soothe, hydrate and restore balance with the Hidehere Cica Care Toner Emulsion — a calming skincare essential designed to refresh the skin while providing lightweight moisture and nourishment.\n\nFormulated with Cica (Centella Asiatica), known for its soothing and skin-supporting properties, this gentle toner emulsion helps comfort stressed-looking skin, improve the appearance of redness and maintain a healthy-looking complexion. Its lightweight texture absorbs beautifully, leaving skin feeling soft, balanced and refreshed.\n\nPerfect for daily use, this multitasking formula helps prepare your skin for the next steps in your skincare routine while delivering essential hydration without feeling heavy.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nSensitive or easily irritated skin\n\nSkin needing calming and hydration\n\nRedness-prone or stressed-looking complexions\n\nMaintaining a smooth, balanced skin barrier\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to the face and gently pat into the skin until absorbed. Follow with your favourite Hidehere moisturiser or cream to lock in hydration.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps soothe and comfort the skin\n\nProvides lightweight hydration\n\nSupports a healthy-looking skin barrier\n\nLeaves skin feeling soft and refreshed\n\nGentle enough for everyday use\n\nSalon One Tip:\n\nUse the Hidehere Cica Care Toner Emulsion after cleansing to create the perfect hydrated base before applying your serums and moisturisers. Ideal for calming the skin while maintaining a fresh, radiant glow."},{"id":17601,"name":"Hidehere Collagen Sleeping Mask","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/COLLAGEN-SLEEPING-MASK-5.webp","description":"Wake up to beautifully refreshed, hydrated, and glowing skin with the HIDEHERE Collagen Sleeping Mask. This luxurious overnight treatment is designed to work while you sleep, helping to deeply nourish, replenish moisture, and support a smoother, more radiant complexion by morning.\n\nInfused with collagen to help improve the look of firmness and elasticity, this lightweight sleeping mask creates a moisture-locking barrier that helps prevent dehydration overnight. Its silky texture absorbs comfortably into the skin, leaving it feeling soft, plump, and revitalised without a heavy or sticky finish.\n\nPerfect for tired, dull, or dehydrated skin, the HIDEHERE Collagen Sleeping Mask is your overnight beauty essential for restoring your skin’s natural glow and giving it the extra care it deserves.\n\nBenefits:\n\nDeeply hydrates and locks in moisture overnight\n\nHelps skin appear smoother and more radiant\n\nSupports a plumper, healthier-looking complexion\n\nHelps revive tired and dull-looking skin\n\nLeaves skin feeling soft, refreshed, and nourished\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing and applying your usual skincare routine, apply an even layer of the HIDEHERE Collagen Sleeping Mask as the final step before bed. Leave on overnight and rinse gently with lukewarm water in the morning. Use 2–3 times per week or whenever your skin needs an extra boost of hydration."},{"id":17598,"name":"Hidehere Green Tea Collagen Gel Cleanser","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/COLLAGEN-GEL-CLEANSER-6.webp","description":"Refresh, cleanse, and hydrate your skin with the gentle power of green tea and collagen. The HIDEHERE Green Tea Collagen Gel Cleanser is a low pH, gentle gel cleanser designed to effectively remove impurities, excess oil, and makeup while helping maintain your skin’s natural moisture balance.\n\nInfused with green tea extract, known for its soothing and antioxidant properties, and hydrolysed collagen to help support a soft, smooth and refreshed skin feel, this cleanser leaves your complexion feeling clean, comfortable, and never stripped.\n\nPerfect for daily use, this lightweight gel formula creates a soft, rich foam that gently cleanses the skin while helping to calm, refresh, and replenish moisture. Ideal for those wanting a simple yet effective first step in their skincare routine.\n\nBenefits:\n\nGently removes dirt, oil & makeup\n\nHelps maintain skin’s moisture balance\n\nRefreshes and soothes the skin\n\nSupports a clean, soft, hydrated finish\n\nSuitable for sensitive skin types\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply a small amount to wet hands and create a soft foam. Massage gently onto damp skin, avoiding the eye area, then rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. Use morning and evening as the first step in your skincare routine."},{"id":17613,"name":"Hidehere Hyaluronic Cream","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HYALURONIC-CREAM-7.webp","description":"Transform your daily skincare routine with the Hidehere Hyaluronic Cream — a luxurious moisturising cream designed to deeply hydrate, nourish and help restore your skin’s natural softness and radiance.\n\nEnriched with Hyaluronic Acid, this lightweight yet nourishing formula helps replenish moisture levels and lock in hydration, leaving skin feeling smooth, comfortable and beautifully refreshed. The silky texture absorbs effortlessly without a greasy finish, making it perfect for everyday use.\n\nIdeal for helping to improve the appearance of dry, dull or dehydrated skin, the Hidehere Hyaluronic Cream supports a healthy-looking complexion with a soft, plump and glowing finish.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDry or dehydrated skin needing lasting moisture\n\nMaintaining a smooth, radiant complexion\n\nDaily hydration and skin nourishment\n\nCreating a soft, healthy glow\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing and applying your essence, gently apply an even layer of Hidehere Hyaluronic Cream to the face and neck. Massage until fully absorbed. Use morning and evening as part of your skincare routine.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nDeeply hydrates and helps retain moisture\n\nLeaves skin feeling soft and smooth\n\nLightweight, comfortable daily moisturiser\n\nHelps improve the look of dull, tired skin\n\nSupports a fresh, radiant complexion\n\nSalon One Tip:\n\nPair with the Hidehere Hyaluronic Essence underneath for a hydration boost, then finish with the Hidehere Collagen Sleeping Mask at night for beautifully nourished, glowing skin by morning."},{"id":17611,"name":"Hidehere Hyaluronic Essence","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/hidehere-hyaluronic-essence-25ml.png","description":"Give your skin a boost of deep hydration with the Hidehere Hyaluronic Essence — a lightweight, moisture-rich formula designed to refresh, plump and restore your skin’s natural glow.\n\nInfused with multiple types of Hyaluronic Acid, this essence helps attract and lock in moisture, supporting a smoother, softer and more supple complexion. Its silky, fast-absorbing texture delivers hydration without feeling heavy, making it the perfect step between cleansing and moisturising.\n\nDesigned to help improve the look of dehydrated, dull or tired skin, the Hidehere Hyaluronic Essence leaves your skin feeling refreshed, balanced and beautifully radiant.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDry or dehydrated skin needing extra moisture\n\nCreating a plumper, healthier-looking complexion\n\nAdding hydration without heaviness\n\nSupporting a smooth, glowing skin finish\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing, apply a few drops of essence to the face and gently pat into the skin until absorbed. Follow with your favourite moisturiser or sleeping mask for added hydration and nourishment.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nDeep hydration with Hyaluronic Acid\n\nHelps improve skin softness and smoothness\n\nLightweight, quick-absorbing formula\n\nEnhances skin’s natural glow\n\nIdeal for daily skincare routines\n\nSalon One Tip:\n\nFor best results, layer your Hidehere Hyaluronic Essence under your moisturiser or sleeping mask to help lock in hydration and keep your skin looking fresh, plump and radiant."},{"id":17603,"name":"Hidehere Hyaluronic Eye Cream","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HYALURONIC-EYE-CREAM-8.webp","description":"Give your delicate eye area the hydration and care it deserves with the HIDEHERE Hyaluronic Eye Cream. This lightweight, nourishing eye treatment is designed to help replenish moisture, smooth the appearance of fine lines, and revive tired-looking eyes for a brighter, more refreshed appearance.\n\nPowered by hyaluronic acid, a powerful moisture-binding ingredient, this eye cream helps deliver long-lasting hydration while supporting a soft, plump, and healthy-looking eye area. Its gentle formula absorbs effortlessly, helping to reduce the look of dryness and leaving the skin feeling silky smooth.\n\nPerfect for daily use, the HIDEHERE Hyaluronic Eye Cream helps protect and nourish the delicate skin around the eyes, making it an essential step in any skincare routine.\n\nBenefits:\n\nProvides intense hydration to the delicate eye area\n\nHelps reduce the appearance of fine lines caused by dryness\n\nSmooths and softens the look of under-eye skin\n\nHelps brighten the appearance of tired eyes\n\nLightweight, gentle formula suitable for daily use\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing and applying your toner or serum, gently tap a small amount around the eye area using your ring finger. Apply morning and evening as part of your daily skincare routine. Avoid direct contact with the eyes."},{"id":17608,"name":"Hidehere Hyaluronic Perfect Cover BB Cream","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/hidehere-hyaluronic-perfect-cover-bb-cream-25ml.png","description":"Achieve a fresh, flawless complexion while caring for your skin with the Hidehere Hyaluronic Perfect Cover BB Cream. This lightweight, multi-functional BB cream combines natural-looking coverage with deep hydration and daily UV protection, leaving your skin smooth, radiant and beautifully even.\n\nInfused with 10 types of Hyaluronic Acid, this formula helps lock in moisture, keeping your skin feeling comfortable and hydrated throughout the day. The silky, non-sticky texture blends effortlessly into the skin, helping to blur imperfections, even skin tone and create a soft, healthy glow.\n\nWith SPF50+ PA+++ protection, it helps defend your skin against daily UV exposure while providing a natural, buildable coverage that feels like your skin — just smoother and more perfected.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nCreating a fresh, glowing everyday base\n\nHydrating dry or dehydrated skin\n\nEvening out complexion and softening imperfections\n\nA lightweight alternative to traditional foundation\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter your skincare routine, apply a small amount evenly across the face and blend using fingertips, a sponge or brush. Build coverage where needed for a more perfected finish.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHydrating BB cream with Hyaluronic Acid\n\nNatural, smooth coverage\n\nHelps brighten and even skin tone\n\nSPF50+ PA+++ sun protection\n\nLightweight, comfortable all-day wear"},{"id":17621,"name":"Hidehere Vita Elixir Cream","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/VITA-ELIXIR-6.webp","description":"Wake up your complexion with the Hidehere Vita Elixir Cream — a nourishing daily moisturiser formulated to brighten, hydrate and leave your skin looking healthy, radiant and revitalised.\n\nPacked with a blend of vitamin-rich ingredients, this luxurious yet lightweight cream helps improve the appearance of dull, uneven skin while delivering long-lasting moisture. It absorbs effortlessly into the skin, providing deep nourishment without feeling heavy, leaving your complexion soft, smooth and beautifully luminous.\n\nPerfect for everyday use, the Hidehere Vita Elixir Cream helps promote a brighter, more even-looking skin tone while supporting a healthy skin barrier and locking in essential hydration.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDull or tired-looking skin\n\nUneven skin tone and lack of radiance\n\nDaily hydration and nourishment\n\nAchieving a naturally healthy glow\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing, toning and applying your serum, gently massage an even layer over the face and neck. Use morning and evening as the final moisturising step in your skincare routine. During the day, follow with sunscreen for added UV protection.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps brighten and revitalise the complexion\n\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes the skin\n\nSupports a more even-looking skin tone\n\nLightweight, non-greasy daily moisturiser\n\nLeaves skin feeling soft, smooth and radiant\n\nSalon One Tip:\n\nFor the ultimate glow-boosting routine, pair the Hidehere Vita Elixir Cream with the Hidehere Vita Elixir Serum and Hidehere Vita Elixir Skin Tone Brightener. Together, they help maximise hydration, enhance radiance and leave your skin looking refreshed and luminous every day."},{"id":17617,"name":"Hidehere Vita Elixir Serum","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/VITA-ELIXIR-SERUM-5.webp","description":"Reveal a brighter, more radiant complexion with the Hidehere Vita Elixir Serum — a lightweight, vitamin-rich serum designed to hydrate, revitalise and enhance your skin’s natural glow.\n\nPowered by a blend of nourishing vitamins and skin-loving ingredients, this fast-absorbing serum helps improve the appearance of dull, uneven skin while delivering lasting hydration. Its silky texture glides effortlessly onto the skin, leaving it feeling smooth, refreshed and luminous without any sticky residue.\n\nPerfect for daily use, the Hidehere Vita Elixir Serum helps support a healthier-looking complexion while promoting a brighter, more even skin tone.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDull or tired-looking skin\n\nUneven skin tone and lack of radiance\n\nDaily hydration and skin revitalisation\n\nAchieving a healthy, glowing complexion\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply 2–3 drops to the face and neck. Gently pat into the skin until fully absorbed before following with your moisturiser. Use morning and evening for best results. If applying in the morning, finish with sunscreen.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps brighten and revitalise the complexion\n\nHydrates for soft, smooth skin\n\nLightweight, fast-absorbing formula\n\nSupports a more even-looking skin tone\n\nLeaves skin looking healthy and radiant\n\nSalon One Tip:\n\nPair the Hidehere Vita Elixir Serum with the Hidehere Vita Elixir Skin Tone Brightener and Hidehere Hyaluronic Cream for the ultimate glow-boosting skincare routine, helping your skin look hydrated, luminous and refreshed every day."},{"id":17606,"name":"Hidehere Vita Elixir Skin Tone Brighter","brand":"Hidehere","price":25,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/VITA-ELIXIR-BRIGHTER-5.webp","description":"Bring back your skin’s natural luminosity with the HIDEHERE Vita Elixir Skin Tone Brighter. This lightweight brightening serum is designed to help improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, dullness, and tired-looking skin, leaving your complexion looking fresher, smoother, and more radiant.\n\nInfused with nourishing vitamins and skin-loving ingredients, this elixir helps to revitalise the skin while supporting a healthy, glowing appearance. Its silky formula absorbs effortlessly, delivering hydration and enhancing your natural skin clarity without feeling heavy or greasy.\n\nPerfect for those wanting to target dull, lacklustre skin, the HIDEHERE Vita Elixir Skin Tone Brighter is a daily skincare essential for achieving a brighter, more even-looking complexion.\n\nBenefits:\n\nHelps brighten the appearance of dull skin\n\nSupports a more even-looking skin tone\n\nProvides lightweight hydration and nourishment\n\nHelps skin look refreshed and radiant\n\nLeaves the complexion smooth and glowing\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply a few drops of the HIDEHERE Vita Elixir Skin Tone Brighter onto the face and gently pat into the skin until absorbed. Follow with your favourite moisturiser. Use morning and evening as part of your skincare routine.\n\nSalon One Tip:\n\nFor best results, layer this elixir underneath your moisturiser or SPF during the day to help maintain a fresh, healthy-looking glow."},{"id":16292,"name":"Nioxin Hair Fall Defense Serum","brand":"Nioxin","price":77,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Nioxin_Hair_Fall_Defense_Serum_70ml_.jpg","description":"A lightweight leave-in scalp treatment designed to help reduce hair fall and support stronger, fuller-looking hair. Formulated with innovative ingredients including SANDALORE™, caffeine, lauric acid, and niacinamide, this daily serum helps improve hair anchorage, nourish the scalp, and strengthen the hair from the root.\n\nPerfect for clients experiencing thinning, increased shedding, or weakened hair, this non-rinse treatment helps create a healthier scalp environment while supporting hair resilience and density. With consistent daily use, visible improvements in hair strength and reduced shedding can be seen over time.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps reduce visible hair fall\n\nSupports stronger hair anchorage\n\nHelps hair feel thicker and fuller\n\nNourishes the scalp and hair follicles\n\nLightweight, non-greasy leave-in formula\n\nSuitable for daily use\n\nHow to Use:\n\nApply up to 15 pumps directly onto dry or damp scalp daily. Massage evenly through the scalp and do not rinse. Use consistently as part of your haircare routine for best results."},{"id":16293,"name":"Nioxin Hair Fall Defense Shampoo","brand":"Nioxin","price":62,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Nioxin_Hair_Fall_Defense_Shampoo_240ml_PI_1_LowRes.jpg","description":"Help reduce hair breakage and support stronger-looking hair with Nioxin Hair Fall Defense Shampoo. Specially formulated for hair experiencing increased shedding and weakness, this gentle cleansing shampoo helps strengthen the hair fibre while improving resilience from root to tip.\n\nPowered by Nioxin’s ProThick Technology™, this formula helps protect against breakage caused by daily styling and environmental stress, leaving hair feeling stronger, healthier, and more manageable.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nHair prone to breakage and visible thinning\nWeak, fragile, or stressed hair\nHair needing strengthening and protection\nAnyone wanting to maintain fuller-looking hair\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps reduce hair breakage from the first use\nStrengthens and protects fragile hair\nHelps improve hair resilience\nSupports a thicker, fuller-looking appearance\nLeaves hair feeling clean, refreshed, and healthy\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and gently massage into the scalp and hair. Rinse thoroughly and follow with Nioxin Hair Fall Defense Conditioner for best results."},{"id":17647,"name":"Nioxin Root Lifting Spray","brand":"Nioxin","price":48,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Root-Lifting-Spray-150-ml.jpg","description":"Nioxin Root Lifting Spray\nTake your volume to the next level with Nioxin Root Lifting Spray. Specially designed for fine or thinning hair, this lightweight styling spray lifts hair from the roots to create instant body, fullness, and long-lasting volume without weighing it down. It leaves hair feeling soft, touchable, and naturally full while helping your style hold throughout the day.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nInstantly lifts hair at the roots for noticeable volume.\nCreates the appearance of thicker, fuller hair.\nLightweight formula won’t leave hair sticky or stiff.\nAdds body and texture while maintaining natural movement.\nPerfect for fine, flat, or thinning hair.\nHelps styles last longer with flexible, touchable hold.\n\nHow to Use:Shake well before use. Spray directly onto damp roots, focusing on areas where you want extra lift and volume. Blow-dry using a round brush for maximum fullness and body."},{"id":17652,"name":"Nioxin Scalp Recovery Conditioner","brand":"Nioxin","price":54,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Scalp-Recovery™-Conditioner-200-ml.jpg","description":"Nioxin Scalp Recovery Conditioner\nComplete your scalp care routine with Nioxin Scalp Recovery Conditioner, specially designed to nourish and protect hair while supporting a healthier scalp environment. This lightweight conditioner helps restore moisture, improve manageability, and leave hair feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed without weighing it down.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps soothe and comfort a dry, irritated scalp.\nSupports the scalp’s natural balance for healthier-looking hair.\nHelps reduce the feeling of dryness and tightness.\nLeaves hair soft, smooth, and easier to style.\nLightweight formula that won’t leave hair feeling heavy.\nHelps improve the overall look and feel of hair affected by scalp concerns.\n\nHow to Use:After shampooing with Nioxin Scalp Recovery Shampoo, apply conditioner through mid-lengths and ends, focusing on areas needing extra moisture. Leave for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For best results, use as part of the complete Nioxin Scalp Recovery System."},{"id":16294,"name":"Nioxin Scalp Recovery Kit","brand":"Nioxin","price":109,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Nioxin_Scalp_Recovery_Kit.png","description":"Restore scalp balance and support healthier-looking hair with Nioxin Scalp Recovery System Kit. Designed for scalps prone to dandruff, itching, and irritation, this three-step system helps cleanse, soothe, and protect the scalp while improving the appearance of weak, fragile hair.\n\nFormulated with Zinc Pyrithione and Green Tea Extract, this targeted system helps combat dandruff-causing microbes, reduce scalp discomfort, and create an optimal environment for healthy-looking hair growth.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDry, flaky, or irritated scalps\nDandruff concerns\nScalp discomfort and itchiness\nHair that feels weakened by scalp imbalance\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps reduce visible dandruff flakes\nHelps soothe and refresh the scalp\nSupports a healthier scalp environment\nStrengthens and protects fragile hair\nLeaves hair feeling clean, refreshed, and manageable\n\nThe 3-Step System Includes:\n\n1. Scalp Recovery Purifying Cleanser Shampoo\n\nGently cleanses the scalp and hair while helping remove flakes and impurities.\n\n2. Scalp Recovery Moisturizing Conditioner\n\nHelps hydrate and soothe the scalp while improving softness and manageability.\n\n3. Scalp Recovery Anti-Dandruff Treatment\n\nA leave-in treatment designed to help calm scalp discomfort and support scalp health.\n\nHow to Use\n\nUse the complete three-step system for best results. Apply shampoo to wet hair and massage into the scalp, rinse thoroughly, then follow with conditioner. Apply the treatment directly to the scalp after washing and leave in.\n\nAvailable as a complete 3-step system."},{"id":17649,"name":"Nioxin Scalp Recovery Shampoo","brand":"Nioxin","price":54,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Scalp-Recovery™-Shampoo-200-ml.jpg","description":"Nioxin Scalp Recovery Shampoo\nSoothe and cleanse your scalp with Nioxin Scalp Recovery Shampoo, specially formulated to help relieve the visible signs of scalp discomfort, including dandruff, flaking, itching, and dryness. Powered by pyrithione zinc, this gentle yet effective shampoo helps restore the scalp’s natural balance while leaving hair feeling clean, healthy, and refreshed.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps control dandruff and reduce visible flakes.\nRelieves scalp itching, irritation, and dryness.\nGently removes impurities and excess oil without stripping the hair.\nSupports a healthier, more balanced scalp environment.\nLeaves hair feeling soft, fresh, and manageable.\nSuitable for regular use on all hair types experiencing scalp concerns.\n\nHow to Use:Massage into wet hair and scalp, working into a rich lather. Leave on for 1–3 minutes before rinsing thoroughly. For best results, use regularly and follow with the Nioxin Scalp Recovery Conditioner."},{"id":17654,"name":"Nioxin Scalp Recovery Soothing Serum","brand":"Nioxin","price":60,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Scalp-Recovery™-Scalp-Treatment-100-ml.jpg","description":"Nioxin Scalp Recovery Soothing Serum\nGive your scalp the care it deserves with Nioxin Scalp Recovery Soothing Serum, a lightweight leave-in treatment designed to calm, refresh, and support a healthier scalp environment. This soothing serum helps relieve the feeling of scalp discomfort while providing targeted care for dry, itchy, or irritated scalps.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps soothe and comfort dry, irritated scalps.\nProvides lightweight hydration without leaving hair greasy.\nHelps reduce the feeling of itchiness and discomfort.\nSupports a healthier scalp environment for better-looking hair.\nEasy leave-in formula that works between washes.\nPerfect addition to your scalp care routine for ongoing comfort and balance.\n\nHow to Use:Apply directly to the scalp after washing or whenever your scalp needs extra care. Massage gently into the scalp and leave in — do not rinse. Use regularly as part of the Nioxin Scalp Recovery System for best results."},{"id":17645,"name":"Nioxin Strong Hold HairSpray","brand":"Nioxin","price":48,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Strong-Hold-Hairspray-300-ml.jpg","description":"Nioxin Strong Hold Hairspray\nKeep your style exactly where you want it with Nioxin Strong Hold Hairspray. Designed to provide all-day, firm hold without stiffness or flaking, this lightweight finishing spray helps maintain volume, shine, and natural movement. It’s perfect for creating long-lasting styles while supporting the appearance of thicker, fuller-looking hair.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nStrong, long-lasting hold that keeps your style in place.\nLightweight formula won’t weigh hair down or leave it feeling sticky.\nHumidity-resistant to help reduce frizz and maintain your look.\nAdds natural-looking shine for a polished finish.\nEasy to brush out without leaving residue.\nIdeal for fine or thinning hair, helping create the appearance of fuller, more voluminous hair.\n\nHow to Use:Hold approximately 30cm from dry, styled hair and spray evenly as a finishing step. Layer as needed for extra hold and control."},{"id":17626,"name":"Nioxin System 1 – Natural Hair – Light Thinning","brand":"Nioxin","price":118,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/System-1-Loyalty-Kit.jpg","description":"Designed for natural, untreated hair experiencing light thinning, Nioxin System 1 is a professional three-step hair care system that helps create the ideal environment for healthier-looking, fuller-looking hair.\n\nFormulated to gently cleanse the scalp, remove excess oil and impurities, and strengthen the hair from root to tip, System 1 leaves hair feeling refreshed, thicker, and more resilient with every wash. Its lightweight formula adds body and volume without weighing the hair down, making it perfect for fine or thinning hair.\n\nBest for:\n\nNatural, untreated hair\nLight thinning\nFine, flat hair needing added volume\n\nBenefits:\n\nPromotes the appearance of thicker, fuller hair\nHelps remove build-up and excess sebum from the scalp\nStrengthens and nourishes the hair\nAdds body and natural-looking volume\nSupports a healthier scalp environment\n\nHow to use:\n\nMassage the cleanser into wet hair and scalp, rinse thoroughly, then apply the Scalp Therapy Conditioner. Finish with the Scalp & Hair Treatment for best results. Suitable for daily use."},{"id":16295,"name":"Nioxin System 2- Natural Hair – Progressed Thinning","brand":"Nioxin","price":118,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Nioxin_System_2_TRIAL_KIT_.jpg","description":"Support thicker, fuller-looking hair with Nioxin System 2 Cleanser Shampoo. Specially designed for natural hair with progressed thinning, this professional 3-part system helps remove dirt, oil, and environmental residue while creating a healthy scalp environment for stronger-looking hair.\n\nFormulated with BioAMP Technology™, Activ-Renewal™, and Transactive Delivery System™, this lightweight cleanser helps strengthen the hair structure, increase fullness, and improve the appearance of thinning areas.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nNatural hair experiencing progressed thinning\nFine, weak, or fragile hair\nHair needing added fullness and density\nMaintaining a healthy-looking scalp\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps remove impurities and excess oil from the scalp\nStrengthens hair against breakage\nHelps provide thicker, fuller-looking hair\nRefreshes and balances the scalp environment\nPrepares hair for the next steps in the Nioxin System\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and gently massage into the scalp and hair. Leave on for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Follow with Nioxin System 2 Scalp Therapy Revitalizing Conditioner and Scalp & Hair Treatment for best results.\n\nPart of the Nioxin 3-Step System 2, designed for natural hair with progressed thinning."},{"id":16296,"name":"Nioxin System 4 – Coloured hair – Progressed Thinning","brand":"Nioxin","price":118,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Nioxin_System_4_TRIAL_KIT.jpg","description":"Maintain your beautiful colour while supporting fuller-looking hair with Nioxin System 4 Cleanser Shampoo. Specially designed for colour-treated hair experiencing progressed thinning, this professional 3-step system helps cleanse the scalp, strengthen the hair fibre, and enhance the appearance of hair density while protecting your colour.\n\nFormulated with BioAMP Technology™, Activ-Renewal™, and Transactive Delivery System™, this lightweight cleanser helps remove dirt, oil, and impurities while creating an optimal scalp environment for stronger, healthier-looking hair.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nColour-treated hair with progressed thinning\nFine, fragile, or weakened hair\nHair needing added fullness and colour protection\nMaintaining a healthy-looking scalp\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps remove buildup and excess oil from the scalp\nHelps strengthen hair against breakage\nSupports thicker, fuller-looking hair\nHelps preserve colour vibrancy\nRefreshes and balances the scalp environment\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and massage gently into the scalp and hair. Leave on for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Follow with Nioxin System 4 Scalp Therapy Revitalizing Conditioner and Scalp & Hair Treatment for best results.\n\nPart of the Nioxin 3-Step System 4, designed for colour-treated hair with progressed thinning."},{"id":17589,"name":"Curly Hair Essentials Bundle","brand":"Salon Essentials","price":176.4,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Curly_Hair_Bundle.png","description":"Designed for: Naturally wavy and curly hair.\n\nGive your waves and curls the care they deserve with our Curly Hair Essentials Package. This trio helps strengthen, hydrate and smooth the hair while enhancing natural curl definition, reducing frizz and adding lightweight shine. Perfect for keeping curls healthy, soft and beautifully manageable every day.\nSystem Professional Keratin Protect Shampoo – $68.50\nA gentle cleansing shampoo that helps strengthen and protect the hair’s keratin structure while maintaining moisture. It leaves curls feeling soft, smooth and easier to manage without stripping the hair.\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair and massage into the scalp and lengths. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if required.\nSystem Professional Keratin Protect Conditioner – $68.50\nA nourishing conditioner that hydrates, smooths and strengthens the hair, helping to reduce frizz while leaving curls soft, defined and manageable.\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 1–3 minutes before rinsing thoroughly.\nWella Oil Reflections Luminous Oil Light – $59.00\nA lightweight finishing oil that enhances shine, smooths frizz and adds softness without weighing curls down. Perfect for defining waves and curls while keeping hair silky and radiant.\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply 1–2 pumps to damp hair before styling or smooth through dry hair as a finishing product to tame flyaways and add shine.\n\nOnline Exclusive Offer – This special bundle price is available exclusively through our website and cannot be redeemed in-store."},{"id":17596,"name":"Fine Hair Essentials Bundle","brand":"Salon Essentials","price":220.95,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Fine_Hair_Bundle.png","description":"Fine Hair Essentials\nGive fine, flat hair the lift it deserves with our Fine Hair Essentials bundle. Specially selected to add body, strengthen strands, and create long-lasting volume without weighing the hair down, this trio leaves your hair feeling fuller, healthier, and beautifully bouncy.\nSystems Professional Volumize Shampoo – $67\nA lightweight cleansing shampoo that gently removes impurities while adding body and fullness. It helps strengthen fine hair and creates the perfect foundation for long-lasting volume.\n\nHow to use: Massage into wet hair, lather, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if needed.\nSystems Professional Volumize Mask – $77.50\nA lightweight intensive treatment that deeply nourishes and strengthens fine hair without leaving it heavy. It improves manageability while maintaining natural movement and volume.\n\nHow to use: After shampooing, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave on for 5–10 minutes before rinsing thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week in place of your regular conditioner.\nSystems Professional Volumize Aerolifter – $101\nA lightweight volumising mousse that provides lift from the roots, enhances body, and leaves hair feeling soft with natural movement and flexible hold.\n\nHow to use: Shake well before use. Apply to towel-dried hair, focusing on the roots and mid-lengths. Blow-dry for maximum volume and lift.\n\nNormally: $245.50\n\nNow: $220.95\n\nYou Save: $24.55\n\nPlease note: This bundle price is exclusively available online and is not available for purchase in-store."},{"id":17594,"name":"Frizzy Hair Essentials Bundle","brand":"Salon Essentials","price":192.6,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frizzy_Hair_Bundle.png","description":"Designed for: Frizzy, dry, or unmanageable hair.\n\nTake control of frizz with our Frizzy Hair Essentials Package. Carefully selected to smooth, nourish and protect the hair, this trio helps leave hair feeling softer, shinier and easier to style. Perfect for anyone wanting sleek, healthy-looking hair with lasting frizz control.\nSystem Professional Smoothen Shampoo – $67.00\nA smoothing shampoo that gently cleanses while helping to control frizz and tame unruly hair. It leaves the hair feeling soft, smooth and more manageable without stripping away essential moisture.\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair, massage into the scalp and through the lengths, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if required.\nSystem Professional LuxeOil Conditioner – $69.00\nA lightweight yet deeply nourishing conditioner that moisturises and smooths the hair while improving softness, shine and manageability. It helps reduce frizz and leaves hair feeling silky without weighing it down.\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 2–3 minutes before rinsing thoroughly.\nSystem Professional Solar Sealing Cream – $78.00\nA leave-in cream that helps protect the hair from UV exposure, dryness and environmental stress while smoothing frizz and enhancing softness. Ideal for keeping hair healthy, hydrated and manageable all year round.\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply a small amount through towel-dried hair, focusing on the mid-lengths and ends. Leave in and style as desired. Can also be used before spending time in the sun for added protection.\n\nOnline Exclusive Offer – This special bundle price is available exclusively through our website and cannot be redeemed in-store."},{"id":17584,"name":"Normal Hair Essentials Bundle","brand":"Salon Essentials","price":120.6,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Normal_Hair_Bundle.png","description":"Perfect for: Those with healthy, balanced hair and scalp who simply want to maintain beautiful, soft, and healthy-looking hair.\n\nIf your hair doesn’t have any major concerns and you’re looking for an easy, effective routine, this package has everything you need to cleanse, condition, and style while keeping your hair in its best condition.\nIncluded Products\nWella Elements Renewing Shampoo\n\nRRP: $48\n\nA gentle, sulphate-free shampoo that effectively cleanses the hair and scalp without stripping away natural moisture. It leaves your hair feeling fresh, soft, and healthy while helping to protect it from everyday stress.\n\nHow to use:\n\nMassage into wet hair, lather, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if desired.\n\nWella Elements Renewing Conditioner\n\nRRP: $48\n\nA lightweight conditioner that instantly detangles, smooths, and nourishes the hair. It helps maintain softness, shine, and manageability without weighing the hair down.\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave on for 1–3 minutes before rinsing thoroughly.\n\nWella EIMI Perfect Me\n\nRRP: $38\n\nA lightweight beauty balm that smooths frizz, adds softness and shine, and helps protect hair from heat during styling. Perfect for achieving a polished, natural finish without feeling heavy.\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply 1–3 pumps to towel-dried hair through the mid-lengths and ends before blow-drying or styling. Can also be used sparingly on dry hair to tame flyaways and add shine.\n\nOnline Exclusive Offer – This special bundle price is available exclusively through our website and cannot be redeemed in-store."},{"id":17592,"name":"Thick Hair Essentials Bundle","brand":"Salon Essentials","price":197.1,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Thick_Hair_Bundle.png","description":"Designed for: Thick, coarse, or unruly hair.\n\nDesigned specifically for clients with thick, coarse, or unruly hair, this bundle delivers intense nourishment, smoothness, and long-lasting manageability. Perfect for taming frizz while enhancing shine and softness.\nWella Ultimate Smooth Shampoo – $65.00\nA deeply cleansing yet nourishing shampoo that smooths the hair cuticle while gently removing impurities. It helps control frizz, leaving thick hair feeling soft, sleek and more manageable.\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair, massage into the scalp and through the lengths, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if required.\nWella Ultimate Smooth Conditioner – $65.00\nAn intensely nourishing conditioner that hydrates and detangles thick hair while reducing frizz and enhancing softness and shine without weighing the hair down.\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 2–3 minutes before rinsing thoroughly.\nWella Ultimate Smooth Miracle Oil – $89.00\nA luxurious lightweight oil that delivers instant shine, smooths frizz and helps protect against humidity. It leaves thick hair feeling silky, polished and beautifully manageable.\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply 1–3 pumps to damp hair before blow-drying or smooth through dry hair as a finishing product to tame flyaways and add brilliant shine.\n\nOnline Exclusive Offer – This special bundle price is available exclusively through our website and cannot be redeemed in-store."},{"id":17656,"name":"System Professional Alpha Energy","brand":"Systems Professional","price":158,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X_Extra-Alpha-Energy_100ml_LowRes.jpg","description":"Revitalise your hair from the roots with Wella System Professional Alpha Energy — a powerful hair and scalp energiser designed to restore strength, fullness and manageability.\n\nThis lightweight leave-in treatment works on the three key pillars of healthy hair — scalp, fibre and texture — helping to improve scalp moisture balance, reduce breakage and support stronger, more resilient hair.\n\nPerfect for hair that feels weak, fine, fragile or lacking vitality, Alpha Energy helps promote nutrient flow to the roots while providing a refreshing cooling sensation to soothe and comfort the scalp. Hair is left feeling healthier, fuller, easier to style and more responsive.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps create visibly fuller, stronger-looking hair\n\nReduces the appearance of breakage and structural damage\n\nSupports a healthy scalp environment\n\nImproves manageability and styling response\n\nLightweight formula with no sticky residue or build-up\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply directly to the scalp and roots on clean, towel-dried hair. Massage gently through the scalp, leave in, and style as usual. For best results, use consistently as part of your personalised System Professional haircare routine.\n\nIdeal for: Fine, weak, fragile hair needing extra energy, strength and support."},{"id":16357,"name":"System Professional Luxe Blonde Bi Phase Spray","brand":"Systems Professional","price":80,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-Professional-Luxeblond-Bi-phase-treatment-180ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional LuxeBlond Bi-Phase UV & Heat Protector\n\nProtect and perfect blonde hair with System Professional LuxeBlond Bi-Phase UV & Heat Protector. This lightweight leave-in spray instantly detangles while helping shield hair from UV damage and heat styling, leaving blonde hair soft, smooth and radiant.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides UV and heat protection to help prevent damage and colour fading.\n\nInstantly detangles and enhances softness and shine.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nNatural, coloured, highlighted or lightened blonde hair that needs protection, hydration and enhanced manageability."},{"id":17662,"name":"System Professional Solar Conditioner","brand":"Systems Professional","price":77,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X-Solar-Hydro-Repair-Cream-200ml-scaled.jpg","description":"Restore softness and shine after sun exposure with Wella System Professional Solar Conditioner — a nourishing conditioner designed to replenish moisture and revive hair exposed to sun, salt water and chlorine.\n\nThis lightweight yet deeply conditioning formula helps to smooth the hair fibre, improve manageability and bring back a healthy-looking finish to dry, stressed summer hair. Perfect for maintaining beautiful, hydrated hair during holidays or whenever your hair is exposed to outdoor elements.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps restore moisture to sun-stressed hair\n\nSmooths and softens the hair fibre\n\nImproves manageability and detangling\n\nHelps reduce the feeling of dryness after sun, salt and chlorine exposure\n\nLeaves hair feeling silky, refreshed and radiant\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing with Wella System Professional Solar Shampoo, apply through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for a few minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use regularly during periods of increased sun, swimming or outdoor exposure.\n\nIdeal for:\n\n☀️ Dry, dehydrated summer hair\n\n🌊 Hair exposed to salt water and chlorine\n\n🏖 Holiday and outdoor lifestyles\n\nAnyone wanting soft, shiny and manageable hair"},{"id":17658,"name":"System Professionals Elastic Force","brand":"Systems Professional","price":130,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X-Extra-Elastic-Force-125ml-scaled.jpg","description":"Wella System Professional Elastic Force\nFlexible hold meets powerful protection with Wella System Professional Elastic Force — a lightweight styling gel designed to strengthen, protect and enhance your hair’s natural movement.\n\nPerfect for creating flexible styles without stiffness, Elastic Force provides long-lasting control while helping to protect the hair fibre from everyday stress. Its advanced formula supports the hair’s natural elasticity, allowing you to style, reshape and move your hair while maintaining a soft, touchable finish.\n\nIdeal for hair needing shape, definition and resilience, Elastic Force helps create styles that feel natural while providing a reliable hold that lasts throughout the day.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nFlexible hold with natural movement\n\nHelps protect and strengthen the hair fibre\n\nCreates definition without a heavy or sticky feel\n\nAllows restyling throughout the day\n\nLeaves hair looking polished and healthy\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply a small amount to damp or dry hair. Work through the areas where you want control, definition or texture, then style as desired.\n\nIdeal for: All hair types wanting flexible styling support, movement and lasting control."},{"id":17691,"name":"System Professionals Purify Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":66,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X-Balance-Purify-Shampoo-250ml_.jpg","description":"Wella System Professional Purify Shampoo\nRefresh and reset your hair with Wella System Professional Purify Shampoo — a deep-cleansing formula designed to remove impurities, build-up and environmental residue while leaving hair feeling clean, fresh and revitalised.\n\nPerfect for hair exposed to pollution, styling products, excess oils or everyday environmental stress, Purify Shampoo gently yet effectively cleanses the hair and scalp without leaving hair feeling stripped. It helps restore a clean foundation, allowing your hair to feel lighter, fresher and more responsive to your personalised haircare routine.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nRemoves product build-up and impurities\n\nDeeply cleanses without over-drying the hair\n\nHelps refresh the scalp and hair fibre\n\nLeaves hair feeling lightweight and revitalised\n\nCreates the perfect base for treatments and styling\n\nHelps restore natural movement and shine\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair and massage into the scalp and lengths. Leave for a few moments to allow the cleansing ingredients to work, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if needed. Use as required depending on build-up and lifestyle.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nHair exposed to styling products\n\n🌿 Oily or congested scalps\n\n💧 Hair needing a fresh reset\n\nSwimmers, gym-goers or anyone exposed to environmental build-up"},{"id":17664,"name":"System Professionals Solar Helio Spray","brand":"Systems Professional","price":77,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X-Balance-Solar-Helio-Spray-125ml-scaled.jpg","description":"System Professional Solar Helio Spray\nShield your hair from summer’s toughest elements with Wella System Professional Solar Helio Spray — a lightweight protective spray designed to help defend hair against UV exposure while maintaining softness, shine and manageability.\n\nThis leave-in formula helps protect the hair fibre from the drying effects of the sun while keeping hair feeling smooth, hydrated and beautifully conditioned. Perfect for beach days, outdoor adventures and everyday sun exposure, Helio Spray helps prevent hair from feeling rough, dry or stressed.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps protect hair from UV damage\n\nProvides lightweight conditioning and moisture\n\nHelps maintain softness and shine\n\nReduces the effects of sun exposure on the hair fibre\n\nLeaves hair feeling smooth, fresh and manageable\n\nHow to use:\n\nSpray evenly through damp or dry hair before sun exposure. Reapply throughout the day as needed, especially after swimming or extended time outdoors.\n\nIdeal for:\n\n☀️ Summer and holiday hair care\n\n🏖 Beach days and outdoor lifestyles\n\n🌊 Hair exposed to sun, salt water and chlorine\n\nAnyone wanting protection, hydration and shine"},{"id":17668,"name":"System Professionals Solar Sealing Cream","brand":"Systems Professional","price":77,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X-Balance-Solar-Sealing-Cream-125ml-scaled.jpg","description":"System Professional Solar Sun Oil\nEnhance and protect your hair during sun exposure with Wella System Professional Solar Sun Oil — a lightweight, nourishing oil designed to help defend the hair fibre while creating a beautiful, glossy finish.\n\nPerfect for summer days, holidays and outdoor adventures, this luxurious oil helps shield hair from the drying effects of the sun while maintaining softness, smoothness and shine. Its lightweight formula helps prevent hair from feeling rough or dehydrated, leaving it looking radiant and healthy.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps protect hair from sun-induced dryness\n\nProvides lightweight nourishment and shine\n\nHelps maintain softness and smoothness\n\nCreates a beautiful, glossy summer finish\n\nHelps keep hair looking healthy and manageable\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply a small amount through mid-lengths and ends before and during sun exposure. Reapply as needed throughout the day, especially after swimming. Can be used on damp or dry hair.\n\nIdeal for:\n\n☀️ Hair exposed to sun and outdoor elements\n\n🏖 Beach and holiday hair care\n\n🌊 Dry, dehydrated or stressed hair\n\nAnyone wanting a silky, radiant summer finish"},{"id":17660,"name":"System Professionals Solar Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":66,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X-Solar-Hair-and-Body-Shampoo-250ml-scaled.jpg","description":"Wella System Professional Solar Shampoo\nProtect your hair after sun, sea and pool exposure with Wella System Professional Solar Shampoo — a gentle cleansing formula designed to remove environmental build-up while restoring moisture and freshness.\n\nPerfect for active lifestyles, holidays and regular swimmers, this nourishing shampoo helps remove waterproof sunscreen, salt and chlorine residue from both the hair and scalp without leaving hair feeling stripped. Enriched with hydrating ingredients, it helps revive tired, sun-exposed hair while improving softness, shine and manageability.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nGently removes sunscreen, salt and chlorine build-up\n\nHelps restore hydration after sun exposure\n\nLeaves hair feeling fresh, soft and revitalised\n\nImproves manageability and shine\n\nSuitable for both hair and body\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair and body, massage into a rich lather, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if needed. For best results, follow with a System Professional Solar treatment to replenish moisture and protect your hair after outdoor exposure.\n\nIdeal for:\n\n☀️ Holiday hair\n\n🏊 Swimmers\n\n🌊 Salt water exposure\n\n🌞 Hair exposed to sun and outdoor elements"},{"id":17666,"name":"System Professionals Solar Sun Oil","brand":"Systems Professional","price":89,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/System-X-Solar-Sun-Oil-100ml_LowRes.jpg","description":"Wella System Professional Solar Sun Oil\nEnhance and protect your hair during sun exposure with Wella System Professional Solar Sun Oil — a lightweight, nourishing oil designed to help defend the hair fibre while creating a beautiful, glossy finish.\n\nPerfect for summer days, holidays and outdoor adventures, this luxurious oil helps shield hair from the drying effects of the sun while maintaining softness, smoothness and shine. Its lightweight formula helps prevent hair from feeling rough or dehydrated, leaving it looking radiant and healthy.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps protect hair from sun-induced dryness\n\nProvides lightweight nourishment and shine\n\nHelps maintain softness and smoothness\n\nCreates a beautiful, glossy summer finish\n\nHelps keep hair looking healthy and manageable\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply a small amount through mid-lengths and ends before and during sun exposure. Reapply as needed throughout the day, especially after swimming. Can be used on damp or dry hair.\n\nIdeal for:\n\n☀️ Hair exposed to sun and outdoor elements\n\n🏖 Beach and holiday hair care\n\n🌊 Dry, dehydrated or stressed hair\n\nAnyone wanting a silky, radiant summer finish"},{"id":16361,"name":"Systems Professional Colour Safe Bi Phase Spray","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Color-Bi-Phase-Conditioner-185ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Color Save Bi-Phase Conditioner\n\nProtect and care for colour-treated hair with System Professional Color Save Bi-Phase Conditioner. This lightweight leave-in spray instantly detangles and conditions while helping to preserve colour vibrancy and enhance shine.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nInstantly detangles and conditions without weighing hair down.\n\nHelps protect colour vibrancy and boosts shine.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nColour-treated, highlighted or chemically processed hair that needs lightweight hydration, colour protection and enhanced manageability."},{"id":16359,"name":"Systems Professional Colour Safe Conditioner","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Color-Save-Conditioner-200ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Color Save Conditioner\n\nMaintain vibrant, healthy-looking colour with System Professional Color Save Conditioner. This lightweight conditioner nourishes and protects colour-treated hair, helping to preserve colour brilliance while leaving hair soft, smooth and easy to manage.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps protect against colour fading and prolongs colour vibrancy.\n\nNourishes and enhances softness, shine and manageability.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nColour-treated, highlighted or chemically processed hair that needs daily hydration and long-lasting colour protection."},{"id":16360,"name":"Systems Professional Colour Safe Mask","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Color-Save-Mask-200ml.jpg","description":"System Professional Color Save Mask\n\nProtect and nourish colour-treated hair with System Professional Color Save Mask. This intensive treatment helps maintain colour vibrancy while deeply conditioning the hair, leaving it soft, smooth and brilliantly radiant.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps protect against colour fading and maintains vibrancy.\n\nDeeply nourishes and enhances softness and shine.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nColour-treated, highlighted or chemically processed hair that needs long-lasting colour protection and hydration."},{"id":16339,"name":"Systems Professional Hydrate Conditioner","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Hydrate-Conditioner-200ml.jpg","description":"The System Professional Hydrate Conditioner is a lightweight, moisturising conditioner designed to instantly replenish dry, dehydrated, and difficult-to-manage hair. It delivers essential hydration while improving softness, smoothness, and manageability without weighing the hair down.\n\nPowered by the EnergyCode™ Complex, this nourishing formula helps restore the hair’s moisture balance, leaving it silky, hydrated, and easier to detangle and style. Perfect for daily use, it provides lightweight care and long-lasting moisture for healthy-looking hair.\n\nPart of the hydration range from Wella Company, this conditioner is the ideal partner to Hydrate Shampoo for soft, manageable, and beautifully hydrated hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly hydrates and nourishes dry hair\nImproves softness and manageability\nHelps detangle and smooth the hair fibre\nLightweight formula that won’t weigh hair down\nRestores moisture balance and shine\nLeaves hair feeling silky, healthy, and refreshed\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, damp hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly.\n\nBest For\n\nDry or dehydrated hair\nHair lacking softness and shine\nCoarse, textured, or frizz-prone hair\nClients wanting lightweight daily hydration and improved manageability"},{"id":16340,"name":"Systems Professional Hydrate Mask","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Hydrate-Mask_200ml.jpg","description":"The System Professional Hydrate Mask is an intensive moisturising treatment designed to deeply hydrate and replenish dry, dehydrated, and hard-to-manage hair. This luxurious mask restores moisture balance, leaving hair feeling soft, smooth, and noticeably more manageable.\n\nFormulated with the EnergyCode™ Complex, this rich treatment helps improve softness and elasticity while protecting the hair from further moisture loss. It delivers long-lasting hydration without weighing the hair down, leaving hair silky, healthy-looking, and full of vitality.\n\nPart of the hydration range from Wella Company, this mask is the perfect weekly treatment for dry or moisture-deprived hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply hydrates and replenishes dry hair\nRestores softness and smoothness\nImproves manageability and elasticity\nHelps protect against moisture loss\nLeaves hair silky, healthy, and shiny\nIntensive weekly treatment for long-lasting hydration\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, towel-dried hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 5–10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or as needed.\n\nBest For\n\nDry, dehydrated, or coarse hair\nHair lacking softness and shine\nCurly or textured hair needing extra moisture\nClients wanting intensive hydration and improved manageability"},{"id":16341,"name":"Systems Professional Hydrate Quenching Mist","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Hydrate-Quenching-Mist-125ml.jpg","description":"The System Professional Hydrate Quenching Mist is a lightweight leave-in conditioning spray that instantly replenishes moisture, improves manageability, and leaves hair feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed.\n\nFormulated with the EnergyCode™ Complex, this hydrating mist helps restore moisture balance while providing lightweight care without weighing the hair down. It detangles, tames frizz, and enhances softness, making it the perfect daily hydration boost for dry, dehydrated, or difficult-to-manage hair.\n\nPart of the hydration range from Wella Company, this leave-in mist delivers long-lasting moisture and silky, healthy-looking results.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly hydrates and refreshes dry hair\nLightweight leave-in formula with no heaviness\nImproves softness and manageability\nHelps detangle and reduce frizz\nEnhances shine and smoothness\nProvides daily moisture protection\n\nHow to Use\nSpray evenly onto towel-dried or dry hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Do not rinse. Comb through and style as desired. Use daily or whenever hair needs an extra boost of hydration.\n\nBest For\n\nDry, dehydrated, or coarse hair\nHair prone to frizz and tangling\nCurly or textured hair needing lightweight moisture\nClients wanting soft, smooth, and healthy-looking hair every day"},{"id":16338,"name":"Systems Professional Hydrate Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Hydrate-Shampoo-250ml_.jpg","description":"The System Professional Hydrate Shampoo is a gentle, moisture-rich cleanser designed to replenish and restore dry, dehydrated, and difficult-to-manage hair. Its lightweight formula cleanses effectively while helping to maintain the hair’s natural moisture balance, leaving it soft, smooth, and full of vitality.\n\nPowered by the EnergyCode™ Complex, this nourishing shampoo delivers long-lasting hydration without weighing the hair down. It helps improve manageability, enhance softness, and reduce the feeling of dryness, making it ideal for daily use.\n\nPart of the hydration range from Wella Company, this shampoo is the perfect first step in restoring healthy-looking, hydrated hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses while replenishing moisture\nHelps restore hydration and softness\nImproves manageability and smoothness\nLeaves hair feeling silky and healthy\nLightweight formula that won’t weigh hair down\nSuitable for daily use on dry or dehydrated hair\n\nHow to Use\nApply to wet hair and massage into a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if necessary. For best results, follow with System Professional Hydrate Conditioner, Mask, or Quenching Mist.\n\nBest For\n\nDry or dehydrated hair\nHair lacking softness and shine\nCoarse, textured, or frizz-prone hair\nClients wanting lightweight, long-lasting hydration and improved manageability"},{"id":16353,"name":"Systems Professional Lipid Booster","brand":"Systems Professional","price":130.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Systems-Professional-Lipid-Booster.jpg","description":"System Professional Liquid Hair is a high-performance molecular hair refilling treatment designed to reconstruct and strengthen damaged, fragile, or chemically treated hair from within.\n\nPowered by a blend of essential amino acids, this professional-grade treatment helps rebuild the hair fibre structure, improving resilience, elasticity, and overall hair quality. Its lightweight, thermo-activated formula works deep inside the hair shaft to “refill” weakened areas, leaving hair visibly stronger, smoother, and more manageable for up to 5 washes.\n\nIdeal for fine, weak, or over-processed hair, Liquid Hair delivers an instant transformation without weighing the hair down."},{"id":16355,"name":"Systems Professional Luxe Blonde Conditioner","brand":"Systems Professional","price":67.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-Professional-Luxeblond-hair-moisturizer-200ml.jpg","description":"System Professional LuxeBlond Conditioner\n\nNourish and strengthen blonde hair with System Professional LuxeBlond Conditioner. This lightweight yet restorative conditioner helps repair and protect lightened hair, leaving it soft, smooth and beautifully radiant without weighing it down.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nStrengthens and helps repair fragile, lightened hair.\n\nEnhances softness, shine and manageability.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nNatural, coloured, highlighted or lightened blonde hair that needs hydration, strength and protection against damage."},{"id":16356,"name":"Systems Professional Luxe Blonde Mask","brand":"Systems Professional","price":82.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-Professional-Luxeblond-Mask-200ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional LuxeBlond Mask\n\nRestore and strengthen blonde hair with System Professional LuxeBlond Mask. This intensive treatment deeply nourishes and repairs lightened hair, helping to reduce breakage while leaving hair soft, smooth and beautifully luminous.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nDeeply repairs and strengthens fragile, lightened hair.\n\nReduces the appearance of damage while enhancing softness and shine.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nNatural, coloured, highlighted or lightened blonde hair that needs intensive repair, hydration and protection against breakage."},{"id":16354,"name":"Systems Professional Luxe Blonde Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":67.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-Professional-Luxeblond-Shampoo-250ml.jpg","description":"System Professional LuxeBlond Shampoo\n\nBrighten and strengthen blonde hair with System Professional LuxeBlond Shampoo. This gentle cleansing formula is specially designed to care for blonde, lightened and highlighted hair, helping to repair damage while leaving hair soft, radiant and beautifully refreshed.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nStrengthens and helps repair fragile, lightened hair.\n\nGently cleanses while enhancing softness and shine.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nNatural, coloured, highlighted or lightened blonde hair that needs strength, nourishment and protection against damage."},{"id":16343,"name":"Systems Professional Repair Conditioner","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Repair-Conditioner-200ml_L.jpg","description":"The System Professional Repair Conditioner is a lightweight, strengthening conditioner designed to restore softness, improve manageability, and help repair damaged or weakened hair. It provides targeted care to compromised areas of the hair fibre while leaving hair smooth, resilient, and easy to detangle.\n\nFormulated with the EnergyCode™ Complex, this nourishing conditioner helps reinforce the hair’s structure, reduce the appearance of damage, and protect against future breakage. Its lightweight formula delivers essential moisture and repair without weighing the hair down, making it suitable for daily use.\n\nPart of the targeted repair range from Wella Company, this conditioner is the perfect partner to Repair Shampoo for stronger, healthier-looking hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps repair and strengthen damaged hair\nImproves softness and manageability\nReduces tangles and smooths the hair fibre\nHelps protect against future breakage\nLightweight conditioning without heaviness\nLeaves hair feeling soft, healthy, and resilient\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, damp hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly.\n\nBest For\n\nDamaged or over-processed hair\nBleached or chemically treated hair\nHair prone to breakage and dryness\nClients wanting stronger, smoother, and healthier-looking hair"},{"id":16344,"name":"Systems Professional Repair Mask","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Repair-Mask-200ml_.jpg","description":"The System Professional Repair Mask is an intensive weekly treatment designed to deeply nourish and repair damaged, weakened, or chemically treated hair. It works at a fibre level to help rebuild strength, restore smoothness, and improve the overall health and manageability of the hair.\n\nFormulated with advanced lipids and conditioning agents, this rich mask targets areas of damage while helping to reinforce the hair structure without leaving it heavy or greasy. Hair is left softer, stronger, and noticeably more resilient after each use.\n\nPerfect as part of a targeted repair regime within the Wella Company System Professional care system.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply repairs and strengthens damaged hair\nImproves softness, shine, and smoothness\nHelps reduce breakage and split ends\nRestores manageability and control\nLightweight rich texture – does not weigh hair down\nIdeal weekly intensive treatment\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, towel-dried hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 5–10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or as advised by your stylist.\n\nBest For\n\nDry, damaged or over-processed hair\nBleached or colour-treated hair\nHair that feels rough, brittle, or lacks elasticity\nClients needing ongoing repair between salon services"},{"id":16345,"name":"Systems Professional Repair Mousse","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Repair-Perfect-Hair-150ml_.jpg","description":"The System Professional Repair Mousse is a lightweight leave-in conditioning foam designed to strengthen and protect damaged, weakened, or chemically treated hair while improving manageability and softness.\n\nPart of the targeted repair system within the Wella Company System Professional range, this mousse helps to reinforce the hair fibre from within while detangling and smoothing the surface of the hair. It delivers conditioning care without heaviness, making it ideal even for finer hair types that need repair but not weight.\n\nHair is left feeling softer, more resilient, and easier to style, with improved control and reduced breakage from daily brushing and heat styling.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nStrengthens and helps repair damaged hair fibre\nLightweight leave-in formula – no heaviness\nImproves softness, smoothness, and shine\nEases detangling and styling\nHelps reduce breakage from brushing and heat\nIdeal for daily use or post-wash care\n\nHow to Use\nShake well. Apply evenly to towel-dried hair from mid-lengths to ends. Do not rinse. Comb through and style as usual. Suitable for regular use after every wash.\n\nBest For\n\nDamaged or chemically treated hair\nFine to medium hair needing repair without weight\nHair prone to breakage or tangling\nClients wanting lightweight daily strengthening care"},{"id":16342,"name":"Systems Professional Repair Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Repair-Shampoo-250ml_.jpg","description":"The System Professional Repair Shampoo is a gentle yet effective cleanser designed to strengthen and restore damaged, weakened, or chemically treated hair. Formulated to cleanse while supporting the hair’s natural structure, it helps improve resilience, softness, and manageability with every wash.\n\nPowered by the EnergyCode™ Complex, this nourishing shampoo helps repair the hair fibre, reducing the appearance of damage and leaving hair feeling stronger, smoother, and healthier. Its lightweight formula cleanses without stripping essential moisture, making it ideal for daily use on fragile or stressed hair.\n\nPart of the targeted repair range from Wella Company, this shampoo is the perfect first step in rebuilding and caring for damaged hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses while helping repair damaged hair\nStrengthens and improves hair resilience\nRestores softness, smoothness, and shine\nHelps reduce the appearance of breakage and damage\nMaintains moisture balance without weighing hair down\nSuitable for daily use on damaged or chemically treated hair\n\nHow to Use\nApply to wet hair and massage into a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if necessary. For best results, follow with System Professional Repair Conditioner, Mask, or Repair Mousse.\n\nBest For\n\nDamaged or over-processed hair\nBleached or colour-treated hair\nHair that feels weak, brittle, or prone to breakage\nClients wanting stronger, healthier, and more manageable hair"},{"id":16363,"name":"Systems Professional Smoothen Conditioner","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/System-X-Smoothen-Conditioner-200ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Smoothen Conditioner\n\nTame frizz and restore silky softness with System Professional Smoothen Conditioner. This nourishing conditioner smooths the hair fibre, improves manageability and helps protect against humidity, leaving hair soft, sleek and easy to style.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nSmooths frizz and helps control flyaways and humidity.\n\nNourishes and improves softness and manageability.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nFrizzy, coarse, thick or unruly hair that needs added smoothness, hydration and long-lasting frizz control."},{"id":16364,"name":"Systems Professional Smoothen Mask","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/System-X-Smoothen-Mask-200ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Smoothen Mask\n\nTransform unruly hair with System Professional Smoothen Mask. This intensive treatment deeply nourishes and smooths the hair fibre, helping to reduce frizz and leaving hair soft, silky and easier to manage.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nDeeply nourishes and smooths frizzy, unruly hair.\n\nHelps control frizz and improves manageability and softness.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nCoarse, frizzy, thick or difficult-to-manage hair that needs smoothness, hydration and enhanced control."},{"id":16362,"name":"Systems Professional Smoothen Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/System-X-Smoothen-Shampoo-250ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Smoothen Shampoo\n\nSmooth and control unruly hair with System Professional Smoothen Shampoo. This gentle cleansing formula helps tame frizz, improve manageability and leave hair feeling soft, silky and beautifully smooth.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nGently cleanses while reducing frizz and flyaways.\n\nImproves smoothness and makes hair easier to manage.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nFrizzy, coarse, thick or difficult-to-manage hair that needs smoothness, softness and enhanced control."},{"id":16366,"name":"Systems Professional Volumize Mask","brand":"Systems Professional","price":76.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Volumize-Mask-200ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Volumize Mask\n\nGive fine hair a boost with System Professional Volumize Mask. This lightweight treatment deeply conditions while adding body and strength, leaving hair feeling fuller, soft and beautifully manageable without weighing it down.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides lightweight nourishment while enhancing volume and body.\n\nStrengthens fine hair and improves manageability.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nFine, flat or limp hair that needs extra fullness, hydration and long-lasting volume."},{"id":16367,"name":"Systems Professional Volumize Mousse","brand":"Systems Professional","price":99,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Systems-Professional-Volumize-Mousse.jpg","description":"System Professional Volumize Mousse\n\nCreate long-lasting body and fullness with System Professional Volumize Mousse. This lightweight styling mousse delivers volume and lift while keeping hair soft, touchable and full of movement.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nAdds long-lasting volume and body without weighing hair down.\n\nProvides lightweight hold while maintaining softness and shine.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nFine, flat or limp hair that needs extra volume, fullness and lift."},{"id":16365,"name":"Systems Professional Volumize Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Volumize-Shampoo-250ml.jpg","description":"System Professional Volumize Shampoo\n\nBoost body and fullness with System Professional Volumize Shampoo. This lightweight cleansing formula gently removes impurities while adding volume and strength, leaving fine hair feeling fuller, refreshed and full of movement.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nAdds lightweight volume and body without weighing hair down.\n\nStrengthens and improves the feel of fine, limp hair.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nFine, flat or limp hair that needs extra fullness, bounce and long-lasting volume."},{"id":16358,"name":"Systems Professionals Colour Safe Shampoo","brand":"Systems Professional","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Color-Save-Shampoo-250ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Color Save Shampoo\n\nProtect and preserve your colour with System Professional Color Save Shampoo. This gentle cleansing formula is specially designed for colour-treated hair, helping to maintain vibrancy while leaving hair soft, smooth and radiant.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps protect against colour fading and keeps colour looking vibrant for longer.\n\nGently cleanses while enhancing softness and shine.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nColour-treated, highlighted or chemically processed hair that needs gentle cleansing and long-lasting colour protection."},{"id":16329,"name":"Elements Renewing Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Elements-Restage-Renewing-Conditioner-Tube-200ml_LowRes.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Elements Renewing Conditioner is a lightweight, moisturising conditioner that instantly detangles, smooths, and strengthens the hair while helping to maintain its natural vitality. Formulated with up to 95% natural origin ingredients*, it provides gentle care and hydration without weighing the hair down.\n\nInfused with Aloe Vera, this nourishing conditioner helps restore softness, improve manageability, and protect the hair from breakage, leaving it feeling silky, healthy, and refreshed.\n\nPerfect for daily use and suitable for all hair types, including colour-treated hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly detangles and smooths the hair\nProvides lightweight hydration and nourishment\nHelps protect against breakage\nLeaves hair soft, healthy, and manageable\nFormulated with Aloe Vera\nUp to 95% natural origin ingredients*\nSuitable for daily use and colour-treated hair\n\nIncluding water, depending on product composition.\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, damp hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly.\n\nBest For\n\nAll hair types\nNormal to dry hair needing lightweight hydration\nColour-treated hair\nClients wanting a gentle, naturally inspired haircare routine"},{"id":16331,"name":"Elements Renewing Leave In Spray","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Element-Renewing-Leave-In-Spray-150ml_.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Elements Renewing Mask is an intensive moisturising treatment designed to deeply nourish and restore smoothness to all hair types. Formulated with up to 95% natural origin ingredients*, this rich yet lightweight mask helps strengthen the hair fibre, reduce breakage, and leave hair feeling soft, healthy, and revitalised.\n\nInfused with Aloe Vera, the Renewing Mask delivers long-lasting hydration while improving manageability and shine. Hair is left silky, nourished, and protected from everyday stress without feeling heavy.\n\nPerfect as a weekly treatment to maintain healthy-looking, beautifully conditioned hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply nourishes and hydrates the hair\nHelps strengthen the hair fibre and reduce breakage\nRestores softness, smoothness, and shine\nImproves manageability and detangling\nFormulated with Aloe Vera\nUp to 95% natural origin ingredients*\nSuitable for all hair types, including colour-treated hair\n\nIncluding water, depending on product composition.\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, towel-dried hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 5–10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or as needed.\n\nBest For\n\nAll hair types\nDry or dehydrated hair needing extra moisture\nHair prone to breakage or dullness\nClients wanting a naturally inspired, deeply nourishing treatment\nColour-treated hair seeking lightweight repair and hydration\n\nElements Renewing Leave In Spray\n\nWella Professionals Elements Renewing Leave-In Spray – 150ml\nThe Wella Professionals Elements Renewing Leave-In Spray is a lightweight multi-benefit conditioning spray designed to hydrate, protect, and improve the manageability of all hair types. Formulated with up to 99% natural origin ingredients*, it helps detangle the hair, reduce frizz, and provide lightweight moisture without weighing it down.\n\nInfused with Aloe Vera, this leave-in spray helps smooth the hair fibre, enhance softness, and protect against everyday environmental stress. Hair is left feeling refreshed, healthy-looking, and easier to style with a natural, touchable finish.\n\nPerfect for daily use on damp or dry hair as part of a gentle, naturally inspired haircare routine.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly detangles and improves manageability\nProvides lightweight hydration and conditioning\nHelps reduce frizz and flyaways\nLeaves hair soft, smooth, and healthy-looking\nProtects against everyday environmental stress\nFormulated with Aloe Vera\nUp to 99% natural origin ingredients*\nSuitable for all hair types, including colour-treated hair\n\nIncluding water, depending on product composition.\n\nHow to Use\nShake well before use. Spray evenly onto damp or dry hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Do not rinse. Comb through and style as desired.\n\nBest For\n\nAll hair types\nHair needing lightweight hydration and detangling\nFrizz-prone or difficult-to-manage hair\nColour-treated hair\nClients wanting a natural, everyday leave-in conditioning spray"},{"id":16330,"name":"Elements Renewing Mask","brand":"Wella","price":52,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Elements-Renewing-Mask-150ml--e1755087632438.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Elements Renewing Mask is an intensive moisturising treatment designed to deeply nourish and restore smoothness to all hair types. Formulated with up to 95% natural origin ingredients*, this rich yet lightweight mask helps strengthen the hair fibre, reduce breakage, and leave hair feeling soft, healthy, and revitalised.\n\nInfused with Aloe Vera, the Renewing Mask delivers long-lasting hydration while improving manageability and shine. Hair is left silky, nourished, and protected from everyday stress without feeling heavy.\n\nPerfect as a weekly treatment to maintain healthy-looking, beautifully conditioned hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply nourishes and hydrates the hair\nHelps strengthen the hair fibre and reduce breakage\nRestores softness, smoothness, and shine\nImproves manageability and detangling\nFormulated with Aloe Vera\nUp to 95% natural origin ingredients*\nSuitable for all hair types, including colour-treated hair\n\nIncluding water, depending on product composition.\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, towel-dried hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 5–10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or as needed.\n\nBest For\n\nAll hair types\nDry or dehydrated hair needing extra moisture\nHair prone to breakage or dullness\nClients wanting a naturally inspired, deeply nourishing treatment\nColour-treated hair seeking lightweight repair and hydration"},{"id":16328,"name":"Elements Renewing Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Elements-Renewing-Shampoo.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Elements Renewing Shampoo is a gentle, sulfate-free cleanser designed to nourish and protect the hair while maintaining its natural moisture balance. Formulated with up to 91% natural origin ingredients*, it effectively removes impurities without stripping the hair, leaving it feeling refreshed, healthy, and revitalised.\n\nInfused with Aloe Vera, this lightweight shampoo helps smooth the hair fibre, improve manageability, and protect against everyday environmental stress. Its gentle formula is suitable for daily use and safe for colour-treated hair.\n\nPerfect for those seeking a naturally inspired haircare routine that delivers healthy-looking, soft, and manageable hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses without stripping moisture\nSulfate-free formula**\nHelps maintain the hair’s natural moisture balance\nLeaves hair soft, smooth, and healthy-looking\nFormulated with Aloe Vera\nUp to 91% natural origin ingredients*\nSuitable for daily use and colour-treated hair\n\nIncluding water, depending on product composition.**Formulated without sulfated surfactants.\n\nHow to Use\nApply to wet hair and massage into a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if necessary. For best results, follow with Elements Renewing Conditioner or Elements Renewing Mask.\n\nBest For\n\nAll hair types\nColour-treated hair\nClients looking for a gentle, sulfate-free shampoo\nHair needing hydration and everyday protection\nThose wanting a naturally inspired haircare routine with lightweight nourishment"},{"id":16326,"name":"Fusion Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/fusion_intense-repair-Conditioner-200ml-Edited-1.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Fusion Intense Repair Conditioner is a rich yet lightweight conditioner designed to help repair damaged hair while protecting it against breakage. Formulated with Silk Amino Acids, it nourishes and strengthens the hair fibre, leaving hair smoother, softer, and more resilient after every use.\n\nThis conditioning formula instantly detangles and improves manageability while helping to reduce the appearance of damage caused by colouring, heat styling, and environmental stress. Hair feels silky, healthy, and easier to style without being weighed down.\n\nPerfect for daily use as part of a complete Fusion repair routine.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps repair and strengthen damaged hair\nProtects against breakage and future damage\nInstantly detangles and improves manageability\nEnriched with Silk Amino Acids for intensive care\nLeaves hair soft, smooth, and healthy-looking\nLightweight conditioning without heaviness\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, damp hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly.\n\nBest For\n\nDamaged or weakened hair\nHair prone to breakage from heat styling or colouring\nChemically treated hair\nClients wanting stronger, smoother, and more resilient hair\nDaily repair and protection for stressed hair fibres"},{"id":16327,"name":"Fusion Mask","brand":"Wella","price":52,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/fusion_intense-repair-shampoo_250ml-Edited-1.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Fusion Intense Repair Mask is a luxurious, intensive treatment designed to repair and protect damaged hair against breakage. Inspired by spider silk, one of nature’s strongest fibres, this deeply nourishing mask helps restore strength, smoothness, and resilience to weakened or stressed hair.\n\nFormulated with Silk Amino Acids, the Fusion Mask penetrates deep into the hair fibre to help repair damage caused by heat styling, colouring, and environmental stress. Hair is left noticeably softer, stronger, and easier to manage with a healthy, silky finish.\n\nPerfect as a weekly treatment for hair that needs intensive repair and protection.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply repairs and strengthens damaged hair\nHelps protect against breakage and future damage\nEnriched with Silk Amino Acids for intensive care\nImproves softness, smoothness, and manageability\nLeaves hair feeling stronger and more resilient\nRestores shine and a healthy-looking finish\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, towel-dried hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 5–10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or as needed.\n\nBest For\n\nDamaged or weakened hair\nHair prone to breakage from heat styling or colouring\nChemically treated hair\nClients wanting intensive repair, strength, and protection\nHair needing softness, resilience, and shine after damage repair"},{"id":16325,"name":"Fusion Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/fusion_intense-repair-shampoo_250ml.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Fusion Intense Repair Shampoo is a luxurious cleansing shampoo designed to help repair damaged hair while protecting it against breakage. Inspired by spider silk, one of nature’s strongest fibres, this gentle formula cleanses the hair while strengthening and restoring its resilience.\n\nEnriched with Silk Amino Acids, Fusion Shampoo penetrates deep into the hair fibre to help repair damage caused by heat styling, colouring, and environmental stress. Hair is left feeling clean, stronger, smoother, and easier to manage without feeling weighed down.\n\nPerfect as the first step in a targeted repair routine for weakened or compromised hair.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses while helping repair damaged hair\nHelps protect against breakage and future damage\nEnriched with Silk Amino Acids for strengthening care\nImproves softness, smoothness, and manageability\nLeaves hair feeling stronger and more resilient\nSuitable for daily use on damaged or chemically treated hair\n\nHow to Use\nApply to wet hair and massage into a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if necessary. For best results, follow with Fusion Conditioner or Fusion Intense Repair Mask.\n\nBest For\n\nDamaged or weakened hair\nHair prone to breakage from colouring or heat styling\nChemically treated hair\nClients wanting stronger, healthier-looking hair\nHair needing repair, resilience, and protection from daily stressors"},{"id":16307,"name":"Invigo Aqua Pure","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Invigo-Aqua-Pure-Shampoo.jpg","description":"Refresh your hair with Wella Invigo Balance Aqua Pure Purifying Shampoo – the perfect deep-cleansing shampoo for removing product build-up, excess oil, impurities, and environmental pollutants without leaving your hair feeling stripped.\n\nEnriched with Lotus Extract, this lightweight formula gently purifies both the hair and scalp, leaving your hair feeling fresh, clean, and full of natural movement. It’s ideal as a weekly reset or before colour services to create the perfect foundation for healthy, beautiful hair.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nRemoving product build-up and impurities\nOily or congested scalps\nHair exposed to pollution and environmental stress\nAll hair types needing a fresh, clean start\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply cleanses hair and scalp\nRemoves styling product residue and pollutants\nLeaves hair feeling lightweight, refreshed, and revitalised\nHelps restore natural shine and movement\nInfused with Lotus Extract for a clean, healthy-looking finish\n\nHow to Use\n\nMassage into wet hair, lather well, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if required. Use once a week or as needed to maintain a fresh, healthy scalp and beautifully clean hair."},{"id":16298,"name":"Invigo Blonde Recharge Cool Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Invigo-Blonde-Recharge-Cool-Conditioner.jpg","description":"Refresh and maintain your beautiful blonde tones with Wella Invigo Blonde Recharge Cool Blonde Shampoo. Specially formulated for blonde, highlighted, and grey hair, this colour-depositing shampoo helps neutralise unwanted yellow tones while enhancing the brightness and vibrancy of your blonde.\n\nInfused with Colour Recharge-Blend™ and colour pigments, this gentle shampoo helps revive cool blonde tones, leaving hair looking fresh, radiant, and salon-beautiful between appointments.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nNatural, highlighted, or colour-treated blondes\nCool blonde and grey hair\nHair needing help with unwanted yellow tones\nMaintaining salon blonde results\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps neutralise unwanted yellow and brassy tones\nRefreshes and enhances cool blonde shades\nHelps maintain blonde vibrancy between salon visits\nLeaves hair feeling soft, clean, and refreshed\nAdds brightness and shine to blonde tones\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and massage through the scalp and lengths. Leave on for 3–5 minutes depending on desired intensity, then rinse thoroughly. Use regularly as needed to maintain your perfect blonde tone."},{"id":16297,"name":"Invigo Blonde Recharge Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Invigo-Blonde-Recharge-Cool-Shampoo.jpg","description":"Refresh and maintain your beautiful blonde tones with Wella Invigo Blonde Recharge Cool Blonde Shampoo. Specially formulated for blonde, highlighted, and grey hair, this colour-depositing shampoo helps neutralise unwanted yellow tones while enhancing the brightness and vibrancy of your blonde.\n\nInfused with Colour Recharge-Blend™ and colour pigments, this gentle shampoo helps revive cool blonde tones, leaving hair looking fresh, radiant, and salon-beautiful between appointments.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nNatural, highlighted, or colour-treated blondes\nCool blonde and grey hair\nHair needing help with unwanted yellow tones\nMaintaining salon blonde results\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps neutralise unwanted yellow and brassy tones\nRefreshes and enhances cool blonde shades\nHelps maintain blonde vibrancy between salon visits\nLeaves hair feeling soft, clean, and refreshed\nAdds brightness and shine to blonde tones\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and massage through the scalp and lengths. Leave on for 3–5 minutes depending on desired intensity, then rinse thoroughly. Use regularly as needed to maintain your perfect blonde tone."},{"id":16309,"name":"Invigo Clean Scalp","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Invigo-Balance-Clean-Scalp.jpg","description":"Say goodbye to flakes and hello to a healthier scalp with Wella Invigo Balance Clean Scalp Anti-Dandruff Shampoo. Formulated to effectively combat dandruff while gently cleansing the hair and scalp, this shampoo helps reduce visible flakes and leaves your scalp feeling refreshed and balanced.\n\nInfused with Piroctone Olamine, a proven anti-dandruff ingredient, it helps fight the cause of dandruff while soothing the scalp. With regular use, hair feels clean, healthy, and easy to manage, while the scalp feels comfortable and revitalised.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDandruff-prone scalps\nDry or flaky scalps\nItchy scalp concerns\nEveryday use for maintaining a healthy scalp\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps reduce visible dandruff flakes\nGently cleanses hair and scalp\nHelps soothe itching and scalp discomfort\nLeaves the scalp feeling fresh and balanced\nHair feels soft, clean, and manageable\n\nHow to Use\n\nMassage into wet hair and scalp until a rich lather forms. Leave on for a few minutes before rinsing thoroughly. Repeat if required. Use regularly for best results."},{"id":16302,"name":"Invigo Colour Brilliance BB Spray","brand":"Wella","price":38,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/INV_CB_Miracle_BB_150_72.jpg","description":"Give colour-treated hair the ultimate finishing touch with Wella Invigo Color Brilliance Miracle BB Spray. This lightweight leave-in treatment helps protect, nourish, and enhance the beauty of your hair while keeping your colour looking vibrant and radiant.\n\nFormulated with the Color Brilliance-Blend™, featuring Lime Caviar and Metal Purifier Technology, this multi-benefit spray helps protect colour vibrancy while improving softness, smoothness, and manageability. Perfect for everyday use, it leaves hair feeling healthy, conditioned, and beautifully refreshed.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nColour-treated hair\nHighlighted, balayaged, or chemically treated hair\nHair needing extra hydration and protection\nEveryday styling and maintenance\n\nKey Benefits\n\nProvides lightweight conditioning and hydration\nHelps protect colour vibrancy\nImproves softness and manageability\nHelps detangle and smooth the hair\nAdds shine without weighing hair down\nHelps protect hair during styling\n\nHow to Use\n\nShake well before use. Spray evenly through clean, damp hair, focusing on the mid-lengths and ends. Comb through and style as desired. Do not rinse."},{"id":16300,"name":"Invigo Colour Brilliance Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/INV_CB_Conditioner_Fine_200_72.jpg","description":"Protect and enhance your colour with Wella Invigo Color Brilliance Color Protection Conditioner. Specially formulated for colour-treated hair, this lightweight conditioner nourishes, detangles, and smooths while helping to maintain vibrant, long-lasting colour and brilliant shine.\n\nPowered by the Color Brilliance-Blend™, featuring Lime Caviar, rich in antioxidants and vitamins, along with Metal Purifier Technology, it helps protect hair from colour fade caused by metals in water, leaving your hair soft, silky, and full of life.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nColour-treated hair\nHighlighted, balayaged, or fashion-coloured hair\nHair needing hydration without feeling heavy\nDaily or regular use\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHelps maintain vibrant, longer-lasting colour\nInstantly detangles and smooths the hair\nLeaves hair soft, shiny, and easy to manage\nHelps protect against colour fading\nFormulated with Lime Caviar and Metal Purifier Technology\n\nHow to Use\n\nAfter shampooing, apply evenly through the mid-lengths and ends of damp hair. Leave on for 30 seconds to 3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For best results, use after Wella Invigo Color Brilliance Color Protection Shampoo."},{"id":16301,"name":"Invigo Colour Brilliance Mask","brand":"Wella","price":46,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/INV_CB_Mask_Fine_150_72.jpg","description":"Treat your colour-treated hair to intense nourishment with Wella Invigo Color Brilliance Vibrant Color Mask. This rich conditioning treatment deeply hydrates and smooths the hair while helping to maintain vibrant, long-lasting colour and brilliant shine.\n\nPowered by the Color Brilliance-Blend™, featuring Lime Caviar, rich in antioxidants and vitamins, along with Metal Purifier Technology, this luxurious mask helps protect colour vibrancy while restoring softness, strength, and manageability. Hair is left feeling silky, healthy, and radiant after every treatment.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nColour-treated hair\nHighlighted, balayaged, or fashion-coloured hair\nDry or chemically treated hair\nWeekly deep conditioning treatments\n\nKey Benefits\n\nIntensively nourishes and hydrates\nHelps maintain vibrant, longer-lasting colour\nEnhances shine and softness\nImproves manageability and reduces frizz\nFormulated with Lime Caviar and Metal Purifier Technology\n\nHow to Use\n\nAfter shampooing, apply generously through the mid-lengths and ends of towel-dried hair. Leave on for 5 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use once or twice a week for optimal colour protection and deep nourishment."},{"id":16299,"name":"Invigo Colour Brilliance Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/INV_CB_Shampoo_Fine_250_72.jpg","description":"Keep your colour looking vibrant for longer with Wella Invigo Color Brilliance Color Protection Shampoo. Specially formulated for colour-treated hair, this nourishing shampoo gently cleanses while helping to protect your hair colour from fading and maintain a healthy, radiant shine.\n\nPowered by the Color Brilliance-Blend™, with Lime Caviar rich in antioxidants and vitamins, plus Metal Purifier Technology, this shampoo helps protect colour vibrancy by reducing the impact of metals found in water that can contribute to colour fading.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nColour-treated hair\nHighlighted or balayaged hair\nHair needing colour protection and shine\nDaily or regular use\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses without stripping colour\nHelps protect against colour fade\nEnhances shine and colour vibrancy\nLeaves hair feeling soft, smooth, and healthy\nFormulated with Lime Caviar and Metal Purifier Technology\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and massage into the scalp and hair until a rich lather forms. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if required. For best results, follow with Wella Invigo Color Brilliance Conditioner or Color Brilliance Mask."},{"id":17259,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Anti – Frizz Cream","brand":"Wella","price":46,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Control_Cream_150_72.jpg","description":"Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Frizz Control Cream\n\nTame frizz and add silky smoothness with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Frizz Control Cream. This nourishing leave-in cream helps control unruly hair, enhances manageability and leaves hair feeling soft, smooth and beautifully conditioned.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nControls frizz and smooths flyaways for a sleek finish.\n\nNourishes and hydrates while improving manageability.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nDry, frizzy, coarse or unruly hair that needs added moisture, smoothness and frizz control."},{"id":16306,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Anti – Frizz Cream","brand":"Wella","price":43,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Control_Cream_150_72.jpg","description":"Revives dry and stressed hair, resulting in deep hydration and nourishment."},{"id":17261,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Conditioner_200_72.jpg","description":"Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Conditioner\n\nInstantly nourish and smooth dry, stressed hair with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Conditioner. This lightweight yet deeply conditioning formula helps restore softness and manageability while protecting hair from further dryness.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nProvides instant nourishment and hydration to dry hair.\n\nImproves softness, smoothness and manageability.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nDry, dehydrated, damaged or chemically treated hair that needs daily moisture and nourishment."},{"id":16304,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Conditioner_200_72.jpg","description":"Treat dry, stressed hair to intense nourishment with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Deep Nourishing Conditioner. This rich, moisturising conditioner instantly smooths and detangles while restoring softness, shine, and manageability.\n\nPowered by the Nutri-Enrich-Blend™, featuring Goji Berry, Oleic Acid, Panthenol, and Vitamin E, it helps replenish lost moisture, protect the hair from further stress, and leave it feeling silky, healthy, and revitalised after every wash.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDry, dehydrated, or stressed hair\nHair lacking softness and shine\nFrizzy or difficult-to-manage hair\nRegular use to maintain healthy-looking hair\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly nourishes and hydrates\nSmooths and detangles the hair\nRestores softness, shine, and manageability\nHelps protect against future dryness\nEnriched with Goji Berry, Panthenol, Oleic Acid, and Vitamin E\n\nHow to Use\n\nAfter shampooing, apply evenly through the mid-lengths and ends of damp hair. Leave on for 30 seconds to 3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For best results, use after Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Deep Nourishing Shampoo."},{"id":17262,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Mask","brand":"Wella","price":46,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Mask_150_72.jpg","description":"Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Deep Nourishing Mask\n\nTreat your hair to an intensive moisture boost with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Deep Nourishing Mask. This rich treatment deeply replenishes and restores dry, stressed hair, leaving it silky, healthy-looking and full of vitality.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nIntensively nourishes and replenishes dry, damaged hair.\n\nRestores softness, shine and healthy-looking vitality.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nVery dry, damaged, coarse or chemically treated hair needing deep hydration and repair."},{"id":16305,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Mask","brand":"Wella","price":46,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Mask_150_72.jpg","description":"Give dry, stressed hair an intensive moisture boost with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Deep Nourishing Mask. This luxurious treatment deeply nourishes and replenishes the hair, leaving it feeling incredibly soft, smooth, and full of healthy-looking shine.\n\nFormulated with the Nutri-Enrich-Blend™, featuring Goji Berry, Oleic Acid, Panthenol, and Vitamin E, this rich mask helps restore moisture, improve elasticity, and protect hair from further dryness and environmental stress. Perfect for hair that needs extra care and hydration.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDry, dehydrated, or stressed hair\nChemically treated or damaged hair\nHair lacking softness and shine\nWeekly deep conditioning treatments\n\nKey Benefits\n\nIntensively nourishes and hydrates the hair\nRestores softness, smoothness, and shine\nImproves manageability and elasticity\nHelps reduce dryness and frizz\nLeaves hair feeling healthy, silky, and revitalised\n\nHow to Use\n\nAfter shampooing, apply generously through the mid-lengths and ends of towel-dried hair. Leave on for 5 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use once or twice a week, or as needed, for deep nourishment and hydration."},{"id":17263,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Shampoo_250_72.jpg","description":"Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Shampoo\n\nRevive dry, stressed and lifeless hair with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Shampoo. Formulated with the Nutri-Enrich Complex, this nourishing shampoo helps restore moisture, leaving hair feeling soft, smooth and full of vitality.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nDeeply nourishes and moisturises dry or damaged hair.\n\nLeaves hair feeling soft, smooth and more manageable.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nDry, dehydrated, damaged or chemically treated hair that needs extra nourishment and hydration."},{"id":16303,"name":"Invigo Nutri Enrich Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/INV_NE_Shampoo_250_72.jpg","description":"Restore softness and vitality to dry or stressed hair with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Deep Nourishing Shampoo. This nourishing shampoo gently cleanses while replenishing moisture, leaving hair feeling smooth, healthy, and full of life.\n\nEnriched with the Nutri-Enrich-Blend™, featuring Goji Berry, Oleic Acid, Panthenol, and Vitamin E, this luxurious formula helps nourish and protect the hair from further stress while improving manageability and shine.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nDry, dehydrated, or stressed hair\nHair needing extra nourishment\nDull or rough hair\nDaily or regular use\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses while deeply nourishing the hair\nRestores softness, smoothness, and shine\nHelps replenish lost moisture\nImproves manageability and reduces dryness\nEnriched with Goji Berry, Panthenol, Oleic Acid, and Vitamin E\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and massage gently into the scalp and hair until a rich lather forms. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if required. For best results, follow with Wella Invigo Nutri-Enrich Deep Nourishing Conditioner or Nutri-Enrich Hair Mask."},{"id":16308,"name":"Invigo Senso Calm","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Invigo-Senso-Calm-Shampoo.jpg","description":"Soothe and care for your scalp with Wella Invigo Balance Senso Calm Sensitive Shampoo. Specially formulated for sensitive, dry, or irritated scalps, this gentle fragrance-free shampoo cleanses the hair while helping to calm discomfort and restore balance.\n\nEnriched with Allantoin, a soothing ingredient known for its calming properties, this shampoo helps relieve scalp irritation while leaving hair feeling soft, healthy, and refreshed. Its gentle formula is suitable for everyday use and is kind to both the hair and scalp.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nSensitive or irritated scalps\nDry, itchy, or uncomfortable scalps\nEveryday gentle cleansing\nAll hair types\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses without irritating the scalp\nHelps soothe dryness, itchiness, and sensitivity\nFragrance-free formula\nLeaves hair feeling soft, healthy, and manageable\nEnriched with calming Allantoin\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and gently massage into the scalp and hair. Lather, then rinse thoroughly. Repeat if required. Suitable for regular use."},{"id":16310,"name":"Invigo Volume Boost Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":41,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Invigo-Volume-boost-Shampoo.jpg","description":"Give fine, flat hair the lift it deserves with Wella Invigo Volume Boost Bodifying Shampoo. This lightweight shampoo gently cleanses while adding body, volume, and natural movement without weighing your hair down.\n\nFormulated with Volume Boost-Blend™, including Cotton Extract and lightweight spring-force polymers, it helps create fuller-looking hair with enhanced bounce and softness. Hair is left feeling clean, manageable, and visibly more voluminous from root to tip.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nFine or flat hair\nHair lacking body and volume\nDaily cleansing\nAnyone wanting lightweight fullness and bounce\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses without weighing hair down\nAdds body, volume, and natural movement\nLeaves hair feeling soft, light, and manageable\nHelps create fuller-looking hair\nEnriched with Cotton Extract for lightweight care\n\nHow to Use\n\nApply to wet hair and massage into the scalp and hair until a rich lather forms. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if required. For best results, follow with Wella Invigo Volume Boost Crystal Mask"},{"id":16334,"name":"Nutri Curls Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/NUTRICURLS_Conditioner_200ml-.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals NutriCurls Conditioner is a lightweight, nourishing conditioner specially designed to hydrate, define, and soften waves and curls. It instantly detangles while helping to enhance natural texture, leaving hair smooth, manageable, and full of bounce.\n\nFormulated with the Nourish-In Complex, featuring jojoba oil and wheat bran extract, this conditioner helps replenish moisture, reduce frizz, and improve curl definition without weighing the hair down. Hair feels hydrated, soft, and beautifully defined with every use.\n\nPerfect for maintaining healthy, hydrated waves and curls with natural movement and shine.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly hydrates and nourishes waves and curls\nHelps define and enhance natural texture\nReduces frizz and improves manageability\nDetangles and softens the hair\nLeaves hair bouncy, shiny, and touchably soft\nLightweight formula that won’t weigh hair down\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, damp hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly.\n\nBest For\n\nWavy, curly, and coily hair types\nDry or frizz-prone hair\nHair needing lightweight moisture and definition\nClients wanting soft, defined, and healthy-looking curls and waves"},{"id":16337,"name":"Nutri Curls Curlixir Balm","brand":"Wella","price":52,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/NUTRICURLS_Curlixir_Balm_150ml.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals NutriCurls Curlixir Balm is a nourishing leave-in balm designed to define, enhance, and control curls while providing long-lasting moisture and frizz protection. This lightweight styling cream helps create soft, bouncy, and beautifully defined curls without stiffness or crunch.\n\nFormulated with the Nourish-In Complex, featuring jojoba oil and wheat bran extract, Curlixir Balm helps nourish the hair, improve manageability, and protect curls from humidity, leaving them smooth, hydrated, and full of movement.\n\nPerfect for enhancing natural curls and creating long-lasting definition with a soft, touchable finish.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDefines and enhances natural curls\nProvides long-lasting moisture and nourishment\nControls frizz and protects against humidity\nLeaves curls soft, bouncy, and touchable\nImproves manageability and shine\nLightweight formula with no crunch or sticky residue\n\nHow to Use\nApply 1–3 pumps evenly through damp hair, focusing on mid-lengths and ends. Scrunch or twist curls into shape and allow to air dry or diffuse for added definition.\n\nBest For\n\nCurly and coily hair types\nHair needing moisture and frizz control\nClients wanting soft, defined, and hydrated curls\nNatural curls that need extra definition and bounce"},{"id":16335,"name":"Nutri Curls Mask","brand":"Wella","price":52,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/NUTRICURLS_Mask_150ml-.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals NutriCurls Mask is an intensive nourishing treatment designed to deeply hydrate, define, and care for waves and curls. This rich yet lightweight mask helps replenish moisture, reduce frizz, and enhance the natural shape and bounce of textured hair.\n\nFormulated with the Nourish-In Complex, featuring jojoba oil and wheat bran extract, the NutriCurls Mask delivers long-lasting hydration while improving softness, manageability, and shine. Hair is left feeling silky, nourished, and beautifully defined without being weighed down.\n\nPerfect as a weekly treatment to keep waves and curls healthy, hydrated, and full of life.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply nourishes and hydrates waves and curls\nEnhances natural definition and bounce\nHelps reduce frizz and improve manageability\nRestores softness and shine\nProvides long-lasting moisture without heaviness\nIdeal as an intensive weekly treatment\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, towel-dried hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 5–10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or as needed.\n\nBest For\n\nWavy, curly, and coily hair types\nDry, dehydrated, or frizz-prone hair\nHair needing extra nourishment and definition\nClients wanting soft, healthy, and beautifully defined curls and waves"},{"id":16333,"name":"Nutri Curls Micellar Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/NUTRICURLS_Micellar_Shampoo_Curls_250ml-.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals NutriCurls Micellar Shampoo is a gentle, low-foaming cleanser specifically designed for curly hair. Formulated with micellar technology, it effectively removes impurities and build-up while maintaining the hair’s natural moisture balance, leaving curls soft, defined, and beautifully nourished.\n\nInfused with the Nourish-In Complex, featuring jojoba oil and wheat bran extract, this shampoo helps reduce frizz, improve manageability, and enhance curl definition without stripping essential moisture.\n\nPerfect for keeping curls hydrated, bouncy, and healthy-looking.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses with micellar technology\nMaintains the hair’s natural moisture balance\nEnhances curl definition and bounce\nHelps reduce frizz and improve manageability\nLeaves curls soft, hydrated, and shiny\nSulfate-free formula for gentle cleansing*\n\nFormulated without added sulfates.\n\nHow to Use\nApply to wet hair and massage gently into the scalp and hair. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if necessary. Follow with your favourite NutriCurls conditioner or treatment for best results.\n\nBest For\n\nCurly and coily hair types\nDry or frizz-prone curls\nHair needing gentle, moisture-rich cleansing\nClients wanting soft, defined, and healthy-looking curls"},{"id":16336,"name":"Nutri Curls Milky Waves Spray","brand":"Wella","price":52,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/NUTRICURLS_Milky_Waves_150ml-.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals NutriCurls Milky Waves is a lightweight leave-in spray designed to nourish and define waves while providing softness, moisture, and frizz control. This conditioning formula enhances the natural texture of wavy hair, leaving it beautifully defined, touchably soft, and full of movement.\n\nInfused with the Nourish-In Complex featuring jojoba oil and wheat bran extract, Milky Waves helps replenish moisture, improve manageability, and protect against frizz and humidity without weighing hair down.\n\nPerfect for creating soft, effortless waves with a natural finish.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDefines and enhances natural waves\nProvides lightweight moisture and nourishment\nControls frizz and improves manageability\nLeaves hair soft, smooth, and touchable\nAdds natural movement and definition\nLightweight formula with no sticky residue\n\nHow to Use\nShake well and spray evenly onto damp hair. Scrunch or twist sections to enhance natural waves and allow to air dry or diffuse for added definition. Can also be used on dry hair to refresh waves between washes.\n\nBest For\n\nWavy hair types\nFine to medium textured curls and waves\nHair needing lightweight moisture and frizz control\nClients wanting soft, natural-looking wave definition"},{"id":16332,"name":"Nutri Curls Shampoo For Waves","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/NUTRICURLS_Shampoo_Waves_250ml.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals NutriCurls Shampoo for Waves is a lightweight, nourishing cleanser specially formulated for wavy hair. It gently removes impurities while enhancing the natural texture of the hair, leaving waves soft, defined, and full of movement.\n\nInfused with the Nourish-In Complex, featuring jojoba oil and wheat bran extract, this shampoo helps provide lightweight moisture, reduce frizz, and improve manageability without weighing the hair down. The gentle formula supports healthy-looking, hydrated waves with a soft, touchable finish.\n\nPerfect for maintaining beautifully defined, effortless waves every day.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses without stripping moisture\nEnhances and defines natural waves\nProvides lightweight hydration and nourishment\nHelps reduce frizz and improve manageability\nLeaves hair soft, shiny, and full of movement\nSuitable for daily use on wavy hair\n\nHow to Use\nApply to wet hair and massage into a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if necessary. For best results, follow with NutriCurls Conditioner for Waves and your preferred NutriCurls styling products.\n\nBest For\n\nNaturally wavy hair\nFine to medium textured waves\nHair prone to frizz and dryness\nClients wanting soft, defined, and healthy-looking waves"},{"id":17260,"name":"Nutricurls Milky Waves Nourishing Spray for Waves","brand":"Wella","price":52,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/NUTRICURLS_Milky_Waves_150ml-.jpg","description":"Wella Nutricurls Milky Waves Nourishing Spray\n\nEnhance and nourish your natural waves with Wella Nutricurls Milky Waves Nourishing Spray. This lightweight leave-in spray provides gentle hydration, helps define waves and controls frizz without weighing the hair down.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHydrates and enhances natural wave definition.\n\nHelps reduce frizz while leaving hair soft and manageable.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nWavy hair types looking for lightweight moisture, frizz control and beautifully defined, natural-looking waves."},{"id":16321,"name":"Oil Reflections Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":44,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Oil-Reflections-conditioner-200ml_.jpg.jpg","description":"The Luminous Instant Conditioner is a 30-second smoothening conditioner created for all hair types to lock moisture in and leave the hair luminous"},{"id":16322,"name":"Oil Reflections Mask","brand":"Wella","price":47,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/WellaProfessionals_OilReflections_LUMINOUS_REBOOST_MASK_150ml.jpg.jpg","description":"Formulated with Oleology Program, helps to protect and prevent against natural lipid degeneration for a smooth and reflective suface. Gentle to hair;"},{"id":16324,"name":"Oil Reflections Oil – Dark","brand":"Wella","price":59,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/WellaProfessionals_OilReflections_LUMINOUS_SMOOTHENING_OIL_100-ml.jpg.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Oil Reflections Luminous Smoothing Oil is a luxurious, versatile hair oil designed to deliver deep nourishment, smoothness, and radiant shine. Suitable for all hair types, especially medium to thick hair, this rich yet lightweight formula helps tame frizz, enhance softness, and leave hair looking beautifully glossy and healthy.\n\nEnriched with Camellia Oil and White Tea Extract, this smoothing oil helps protect the hair from moisture loss while improving manageability and creating a silky-smooth finish. Whether used before styling, as a finishing touch, or as an overnight treatment, it provides instant shine and long-lasting softness.\n\nPerfect for achieving polished, healthy-looking hair with exceptional luminosity.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly smooths and adds brilliant shine\nNourishes and softens the hair fibre\nHelps control frizz and flyaways\nEnhances manageability and softness\nProtects against moisture loss\nLightweight formula with a luxurious feel\nCan be used on damp or dry hair\n\nHow to Use\nApply 1–3 pumps through mid-lengths and ends of damp hair before styling, or smooth through dry hair as a finishing product. Can also be applied overnight for an intensive nourishment treatment.\n\nBest For\n\nMedium to thick hair types\nDry, dull, or frizz-prone hair\nHair needing extra nourishment and shine\nClients wanting a smooth, glossy, salon-finished look\nDaily styling, finishing, or overnight conditioning treatments"},{"id":16323,"name":"Oil Reflections Oil – Light","brand":"Wella","price":59,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/4015400793229_WellaProfessionals_OilReflections_LIGHT_LUMINOUS_REFLECTIVE_OIL_100ml_PI_1.jpg.jpg","description":"The Wella Professionals Oil Reflections Luminous Light Oil is a lightweight finishing oil designed to instantly smooth, illuminate, and nourish fine to normal hair. This luxurious formula enhances natural shine while leaving the hair feeling silky soft and weightlessly smooth.\n\nEnriched with Camellia Oil and White Tea Extract, this versatile oil helps control frizz, improve manageability, and protect the hair from moisture loss. Its lightweight texture absorbs quickly into the hair, delivering radiant shine without leaving a greasy residue.\n\nPerfect for everyday use, this illuminating oil creates a glossy, healthy-looking finish while maintaining natural movement.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly enhances shine and luminosity\nLightweight formula ideal for fine to normal hair\nSmooths frizz and flyaways\nNourishes without weighing hair down\nLeaves hair silky, soft, and manageable\nHelps protect against moisture loss\nProvides a polished, glossy finish\n\nHow to Use\nApply 1–2 pumps to damp hair before blow-drying or smooth through dry hair as a finishing product. Focus on mid-lengths and ends. Adjust the amount according to hair length and thickness.\n\nBest For\n\nFine to normal hair types\nHair needing lightweight nourishment and shine\nFrizz-prone or dull hair\nClients wanting a smooth, glossy finish without heaviness\nDaily styling and finishing care for radiant, healthy-looking hair"},{"id":16320,"name":"Oil Reflections Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":44,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Wella-Pro_OilReflections_Shampoo_250ml.jpg.jpg","description":"Light moisturizing shampoo leaves the hair deeply cleansed and luminous."},{"id":16368,"name":"Systems Professional Balance Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":65,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Balance-Purify-Shampoo-250ml_.jpg","description":"System Professional Balance Shampoo\n\nSoothe and gently cleanse sensitive scalps with System Professional Balance Shampoo. This calming formula is designed to relieve dryness and discomfort while leaving the hair feeling refreshed, healthy and beautifully clean.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nGently cleanses while soothing and calming sensitive scalps.\n\nHelps reduce feelings of dryness, tightness and scalp discomfort.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nSensitive, dry or irritated scalps and anyone looking for a gentle, calming daily shampoo."},{"id":16347,"name":"Systems Professional Luxe Oil Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":67.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Luxeoil-Keratin-Conditioning-Cream-200ml_.jpg","description":"The System Professional LuxeOil Conditioner is a lightweight yet nourishing conditioner designed to instantly soften, smooth, and detangle the hair while protecting its natural keratin structure. It delivers luxurious care without weighing the hair down, making it ideal for everyday use.\n\nFormulated with a blend of lightweight oils, this conditioner helps improve manageability, enhance shine, and reduce frizz while maintaining natural movement and softness. Hair is left silky, smooth, and easier to style after every wash.\n\nPart of the premium LuxeOil system within the Wella Company range, it is the perfect follow-up to LuxeOil Shampoo for soft, polished results.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nInstantly softens and smooths hair\nLightweight conditioning – no heaviness\nHelps detangle and improve manageability\nAdds shine and reduces frizz\nProtects keratin and improves hair texture\nSuitable for daily use\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, damp hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 1–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly.\n\nBest For\n\nDry, frizzy, or dull hair\nHair needing lightweight daily conditioning\nAll hair types wanting smooth, shiny results\nClients who prefer soft, manageable hair without weight"},{"id":16348,"name":"Systems Professional Luxe Oil Mask","brand":"Wella","price":82.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Luxeoil-Keratin-Restore-Mask-200ml_.jpg","description":"The System Professional LuxeOil Keratin Restore Mask is an intensive treatment designed to deeply nourish, strengthen, and restore the hair while protecting its natural keratin structure. It provides rich care without heaviness, leaving hair feeling smooth, strong, and deeply conditioned.\n\nInfused with a luxurious blend of lightweight oils, this mask penetrates the hair fibre to improve softness, shine, and manageability while helping to reduce frizz and dryness. It is ideal as a weekly treatment for hair that needs extra nourishment and repair.\n\nAs part of the LuxeOil system within the Wella Company range, this mask delivers salon-quality smoothness and shine from home.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nDeeply nourishes and restores dry or stressed hair\nStrengthens and helps protect keratin structure\nImproves softness, shine, and smoothness\nReduces frizz and dryness\nLightweight rich treatment – no heaviness\nIdeal weekly intensive care\n\nHow to Use\nApply to clean, towel-dried hair after shampooing. Distribute evenly through mid-lengths and ends. Leave for 5–10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week.\n\nBest For\n\nDry, frizzy, or damaged hair\nHair needing weekly intensive nourishment\nChemically treated or heat-styled hair\nClients wanting smooth, glossy, healthy-looking hair"},{"id":16350,"name":"Systems Professional Luxe Oil Recontrustion Elixir","brand":"Wella","price":88,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Luxeoil-Reconstructive-Elixir-100ml.jpg","description":"System Professional LuxeOil Reconstructive Elixir\n\nTransform your hair with System Professional LuxeOil Reconstructive Elixir. This luxurious lightweight oil helps reconstruct and protect the hair fibre while delivering exceptional smoothness, shine and softness without weighing the hair down.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHelps strengthen and protect the hair fibre while reducing frizz.\n\nAdds incredible shine, softness and smoothness without heaviness.\n\nIdeal For:\n\nAll hair types, especially dry, damaged or frizzy hair looking for nourishment, protection and a silky-smooth finish."},{"id":16346,"name":"Systems Professional Luxe Oil Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":67.5,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/System-X-Luxeoil-Keratin-Protect-Shampoo-250ml_.jpg","description":"The System Professional LuxeOil Shampoo is a luxurious cleansing formula designed to gently cleanse the hair while protecting and enhancing its natural keratin structure. It provides lightweight nourishment without weighing the hair down, leaving it soft, smooth, and beautifully manageable.\n\nInfused with a blend of lightweight oils, this shampoo helps to improve hair texture, add shine, and reduce frizz while maintaining natural movement. It is ideal for daily use and works especially well as the first step in a smoothing and conditioning routine.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nGently cleanses while nourishing the hair\nHelps protect and smooth the keratin structure\nAdds lightweight shine and softness\nReduces frizz and improves manageability\nLeaves hair feeling silky without heaviness\nSuitable for daily use\n\nHow to Use\nApply to wet hair and massage into a lather. Rinse thoroughly. Repeat if needed. For best results, follow with LuxeOil Conditioner or Mask.\n\nBest For\n\nDry, dull, or frizzy hair\nHair needing smoothness and shine\nAll hair types wanting lightweight nourishment\nClients who prefer luxury daily care"},{"id":17710,"name":"Ultimate Smooth Miracle Oil Serum 100ml","brand":"Wella","price":88,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ultimate_Smooth_Oil_Serum_100ml-scaled.png","description":"Transform dry, dull and unruly hair with our Ultimate Smooth Miracle Oil Serum. This luxurious lightweight serum helps smooth frizz, tame flyaways and enhance shine, leaving hair feeling silky, soft and beautifully polished.\n\nPerfect for everyday use, it helps protect the hair from humidity while creating a smooth, glossy finish without weighing it down. Your secret weapon for effortlessly smooth, salon-fresh hair.\n\nPerfect for: Frizzy, dry, coarse or unruly hair\n\nBenefits: Smooths • Controls frizz • Boosts shine • Softens • Helps protect against humidity"},{"id":17708,"name":"Ultimate Smooth Miracle Oil Serum 30ml","brand":"Wella","price":44,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wella-Professionals_Ultimate-North-Star_Ultimate-SMooth_Miracle-Hair-Serum_30ml_PI1-scaled.jpg","description":"Transform dry, dull and unruly hair with our Ultimate Smooth Miracle Oil Serum. This luxurious lightweight serum helps smooth frizz, tame flyaways and enhance shine, leaving hair feeling silky, soft and beautifully polished.\n\nPerfect for everyday use, it helps protect the hair from humidity while creating a smooth, glossy finish without weighing it down. Your secret weapon for effortlessly smooth, salon-fresh hair.\n\nPerfect for: Frizzy, dry, coarse or unruly hair\n\nBenefits: Smooths • Controls frizz • Boosts shine • Softens • Helps protect against humidity"},{"id":16319,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask -Pearl Blonde","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-MaskPearl-Blonde-150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Pearl Blonde is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16315,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask –  Caramel Glaze","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask_Caramel-Glaze-150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Caramel Glaze is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16314,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask – Chocolate Touch","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask_Chocolate-Touch-150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Chocolate Touch is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16313,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask – Cool Espresso","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask-COOL-EXPRESSO_150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Cool Espresso is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16312,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask – Copper Glow","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask_Copper-Glow-150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Copper Glow is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16317,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask – Golden Gloss","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask_Golden-Gloss-150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Golden Gloss is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16318,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask – Iilac Frost","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask_ilac-Frost-150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask Lilac Frost is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16316,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask – Peach Blush","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask-PEACH_150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Peach Blush is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":16311,"name":"Wella Colour Fresh Mask – Red","brand":"Wella","price":40,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Color-Fresh-Mask_Red-150ml.jpg","description":"Color Fresh Mask in Red is a zero-damage color depositing hair mask and hair glossing treatment designed to maintain colour"},{"id":17672,"name":"Wella Ultimate Colour Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":64,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/PNG_HighRes-Wella-Professionals_Ultimate-Color_e-comm_PDP_Conditioner-200ml_PI_1-scaled.png","description":"Wella Ultimate Colour Conditioner\nNourish, protect and prolong your colour with Wella Ultimate Colour Conditioner — a lightweight yet deeply conditioning formula designed to keep colour-treated hair soft, vibrant and beautifully healthy.\n\nFormulated to lock in moisture while helping preserve colour vibrancy, this conditioner smooths the hair fibre, enhances shine and improves manageability without weighing hair down. Featuring Metal Purifier technology and nourishing ingredients, it helps protect your colour from fading caused by environmental impurities, leaving your hair looking salon-fresh for longer.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps protect colour for longer-lasting vibrancy\n\nDeeply hydrates without weighing hair down\n\nSmooths the hair fibre for enhanced softness and shine\n\nImproves manageability and reduces frizz\n\nSuitable for all colour-treated hair types\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing with Wella Ultimate Colour Shampoo, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave on for 2–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For enhanced colour care, use alongside the Ultimate Colour range.\n\nIdeal for:\n\n🎨 Colour-treated hair\n\nHair needing moisture, shine and colour protection\n\n💜 Fresh salon colour maintenance\n\n🌿 Anyone wanting silky, healthy-looking hair with long-lasting colour"},{"id":17674,"name":"Wella Ultimate Colour Leave – In Mask","brand":"Wella","price":88,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/PNG_HighRes-Wella-Professionals_Ultimate-Color_e-comm_PDP_Miracle_Leave-in_Mask-95ml_PI_2-scaled.png","description":"Wella Ultimate Repair Protective Leave-In\nRepair, protect and strengthen your hair with Wella Ultimate Repair Protective Leave-In — a lightweight leave-in treatment that delivers intense repair while shielding hair from daily damage.\n\nDesigned for damaged, dry and chemically treated hair, this multi-benefit formula helps repair the hair inside and out, leaving it stronger, smoother and noticeably healthier. It provides heat protection, helps reduce breakage and frizz, and leaves hair feeling soft without weighing it down.\n\nPerfect as the final step in your haircare routine, this leave-in treatment protects against heat styling and environmental stress while improving manageability and shine.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nRepairs and strengthens damaged hair\n\nHelps reduce breakage and split ends\n\nProvides heat protection before styling\n\nControls frizz and improves manageability\n\nLeaves hair soft, smooth and full of shine\n\nLightweight formula suitable for daily use\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply 1–3 pumps to clean, towel-dried hair, focusing on the mid-lengths and ends. Do not rinse. Comb through evenly and style as desired.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nDamaged or chemically treated hair\n\n🔥 Hair regularly exposed to heat styling\n\n💛 Dry, brittle or fragile hair needing repair and protection\n\n🌿 Anyone wanting stronger, healthier-looking hair"},{"id":17670,"name":"Wella Ultimate Colour Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":64,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/PNG_HighRes-Wella-Professionals_Ultimate-Color_e-comm_PDP_Shampoo-250ml_PI_1-scaled.png","description":"Wella Ultimate Colour Shampoo – Sulfate Free\nKeep your colour vibrant for longer with Wella Ultimate Colour Shampoo — a luxurious cleanser specially formulated to protect coloured hair while delivering lasting shine and softness.\n\nDesigned to gently cleanse without stripping colour, this colour-safe shampoo helps preserve vibrancy, reduce fading and leave hair feeling healthy, smooth and refreshed. Enriched with Metal Purifier technology and nourishing ingredients, it helps protect the hair from impurities that can affect colour longevity, while promoting a radiant, salon-fresh finish.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nGently cleanses while protecting colour vibrancy\n\nHelps reduce colour fading for longer-lasting results\n\nLeaves hair soft, smooth and full of shine\n\nHelps protect against impurities that can dull colour\n\nSuitable for all types of colour-treated hair\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair and massage into a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if needed. For best results, follow with Wella Ultimate Colour Conditioner or Ultimate Colour Mask.\n\nIdeal for:\n\n🎨 Colour-treated hair\n\nHair needing long-lasting vibrancy and shine\n\n💜 Fresh salon colour maintenance\n\n🌿 Anyone wanting healthy, radiant-looking coloured hair"},{"id":17677,"name":"Wella Ultimate Colour Shine Spray","brand":"Wella","price":64,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/PNG_HighRes-Wella-Professionals_Ultimate-Color_e-comm_PDP_Shine_Spray-95ml_PI_1-scaled.png","description":"Wella Ultimate Smooth Shine Spray\nFinish your style with radiant, weightless shine using Wella Ultimate Smooth Shine Spray — a lightweight finishing spray that enhances brilliance while helping to control frizz and flyaways.\n\nPerfect for all hair types, this ultra-fine mist instantly boosts shine without leaving hair feeling greasy or heavy. It smooths the hair surface, leaving your style looking polished, silky and salon-fresh while helping protect against humidity for a sleek, long-lasting finish.\n\nWhether you’re completing a blow wave, styling curls or refreshing your hair throughout the day, Ultimate Smooth Shine Spray delivers a luminous, healthy-looking glow with every spray.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nInstantly adds brilliant, glossy shine\n\nSmooths frizz and flyaways\n\nLightweight, non-greasy formula\n\nHelps protect against humidity for a polished finish\n\nSuitable for all hair types\n\nHow to use:\n\nHold the can approximately 20–30cm from dry, styled hair and mist evenly as the finishing step in your styling routine. Use lightly to build your desired level of shine.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nAll hair types\n\n💫 Dull or lacklustre hair needing extra shine\n\n🌿 Finished styles requiring a smooth, polished look\n\n💛 Anyone wanting a lightweight, salon-quality glossy finish"},{"id":17688,"name":"Wella Ultimate Reapir Mask","brand":"Wella","price":66,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wella_Ultimate-Repair_mask_150ml_.jpg","description":"Wella Ultimate Repair Mask\nGive damaged hair the intensive care it deserves with Wella Ultimate Repair Mask — a rich, restorative treatment designed to deeply nourish, strengthen and transform weakened hair.\n\nThis luxurious mask helps repair the look and feel of damaged hair caused by colouring, chemical treatments, heat styling and daily stress. Its advanced formula works to restore softness, smoothness and resilience, leaving hair feeling healthier, stronger and beautifully renewed.\n\nPowered by Metal Purifier technology, Ultimate Repair Mask helps protect the hair from impurities that can contribute to damage, while delivering intense nourishment and a salon-quality finish.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nProvides intensive repair and nourishment\n\nHelps strengthen weak, damaged hair\n\nRestores softness, smoothness and shine\n\nHelps improve manageability and reduce the feeling of dryness\n\nLeaves hair feeling healthier and more resilient\n\nPerfect for a weekly repair boost\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing, apply generously through the mid-lengths and ends of clean, damp hair. Leave on for 5 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or whenever your hair needs extra repair and nourishment.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nDamaged, dry or fragile hair\n\n🔥 Hair affected by heat styling\n\n🎨 Coloured or chemically treated hair\n\n💛 Anyone wanting stronger, smoother and healthier-looking hair"},{"id":17686,"name":"Wella Ultimate Repair Deep Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":64,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ultimate-Repair_deep-conditioner_200ml_LowRes.jpg","description":"Wella Ultimate Repair Conditioner\nStrengthen, nourish and restore damaged hair with Wella Ultimate Repair Conditioner — a deeply conditioning formula designed to improve softness, resilience and manageability.\n\nCreated for hair weakened by colouring, chemical treatments, heat styling and everyday stress, this luxurious conditioner helps repair the look and feel of damaged hair while smoothing the hair fibre. It helps reduce the feeling of dryness and roughness, leaving hair softer, stronger and easier to style.\n\nPowered by Metal Purifier technology, Ultimate Repair helps protect hair from impurities that can contribute to damage, while restoring a healthy-looking shine and smooth finish.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps repair the appearance of damaged hair\n\nStrengthens and nourishes fragile strands\n\nSmooths the hair fibre for improved manageability\n\nHelps reduce the feeling of dryness and roughness\n\nLeaves hair soft, silky and healthy-looking\n\nEnhances shine and smoothness\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing with Wella Ultimate Repair Shampoo, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave on for 2–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For best results, use alongside the complete Wella Ultimate Repair routine.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nDamaged, dry or fragile hair\n\n🔥 Hair exposed to heat styling\n\n🎨 Chemically treated or coloured hair\n\n💛 Anyone wanting stronger, smoother and healthier-looking hair"},{"id":17684,"name":"Wella Ultimate Repair Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":64,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ultimate-Repair_shampoo_250ml_LowRes.jpg","description":"Wella Ultimate Repair Shampoo\nRestore strength and resilience with Wella Ultimate Repair Shampoo — a luxurious cleansing formula designed to repair, strengthen and revive damaged, fragile hair.\n\nCreated for hair that has been weakened by colouring, chemical services, heat styling and environmental stress, this gentle yet powerful shampoo helps cleanse while repairing the look and feel of damaged hair. Its advanced formula works to rebuild the hair’s structure, leaving it smoother, stronger and visibly healthier.\n\nPowered by Metal Purifier technology, Ultimate Repair helps protect the hair from impurities that can contribute to damage, while delivering softness, shine and improved manageability.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nHelps repair the appearance of damaged hair\n\nStrengthens weak, fragile strands\n\nGently cleanses without stripping moisture\n\nHelps reduce the look of breakage and dryness\n\nLeaves hair smoother, softer and more resilient\n\nRestores a healthy-looking shine\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair and massage into the scalp and lengths to create a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if needed. Follow with Wella Ultimate Repair Conditioner, Mask or Protective Leave-In for best results.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nDamaged or chemically treated hair\n\n🔥 Hair affected by heat styling\n\n💛 Dry, brittle or weakened hair\n\n🌿 Anyone wanting stronger, healthier-looking hair"},{"id":17680,"name":"Wella Ultimate Smooth Conditioner","brand":"Wella","price":64,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wella_Ultimate-Smooth_conditioner_200ml_.jpg","description":"Wella Ultimate Smooth Conditioner\nExperience silky, smooth and beautifully manageable hair with Wella Ultimate Smooth Conditioner — a nourishing conditioner designed to soften, tame and transform dry, unruly hair.\n\nFormulated to deeply condition while smoothing the hair fibre, this luxurious conditioner helps reduce the feeling of roughness and frizz, leaving hair easier to detangle, style and maintain. Powered by Metal Purifier technology and enriched with nourishing ingredients, it helps protect hair from impurities while creating a soft, polished and healthy-looking finish.\n\nPerfect for achieving a salon-smooth result, Ultimate Smooth Conditioner leaves hair feeling lightweight, touchable and full of shine.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nDeeply nourishes and smooths dry, unruly hair\n\nHelps control frizz and improve manageability\n\nLeaves hair feeling silky, soft and polished\n\nEnhances shine without weighing hair down\n\nHelps protect against environmental impurities\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing with Wella Ultimate Smooth Shampoo, apply through the mid-lengths and ends. Leave on for 2–3 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For best results, use as part of the complete Wella Ultimate Smooth routine.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nDry, frizzy or coarse hair\n\n🌿 Hair needing softness, smoothness and control\n\n💫 Anyone wanting a sleek, salon-smooth finish\n\n🤍 Hair that feels rough, unruly or difficult to manage"},{"id":17682,"name":"Wella Ultimate Smooth Mask","brand":"Wella","price":66,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wella_Ultimate-Smooth_mask_150ml_.jpg","description":"Wella Ultimate Smooth Mask\nIndulge your hair with Wella Ultimate Smooth Mask — a luxurious deep-conditioning treatment designed to transform dry, unruly hair into silky, smooth and beautifully nourished locks.\n\nThis rich yet lightweight mask provides intensive care to help soften the hair fibre, improve manageability and reduce the feeling of roughness. Powered by Metal Purifier technology and nourishing ingredients, it helps protect hair from impurities while restoring a healthy-looking shine and smooth finish.\n\nPerfect as a weekly treatment, Ultimate Smooth Mask helps revive stressed, frizzy and difficult-to-manage hair, leaving it feeling soft, polished and salon-fresh.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nDeeply nourishes and smooths dry, unruly hair\n\nHelps reduce frizz and improve manageability\n\nRestores softness and silky texture\n\nEnhances shine for a healthy-looking finish\n\nHelps protect hair from environmental impurities\n\nProvides a luxurious salon-quality treatment at home\n\nHow to use:\n\nAfter shampooing, apply generously through the mid-lengths and ends of clean, damp hair. Leave on for 5 minutes, then rinse thoroughly. Use 1–2 times per week or whenever your hair needs extra nourishment.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nDry, frizzy or coarse hair\n\n🌿 Hair needing intense softness and smoothing\n\n💫 Anyone wanting a sleek, polished finish\n\n🤍 Hair that feels rough, unruly or difficult to manage"},{"id":17678,"name":"Wella Ultimate Smooth Shampoo","brand":"Wella","price":64,"image":"https://salonone.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wella_Ultimate_Smooth_shampoo_250ml_.jpg","description":"Wella Ultimate Smooth Shampoo\nTransform dry, unruly hair with Wella Ultimate Smooth Shampoo — a luxurious cleansing formula designed to nourish, smooth and restore softness for a beautifully polished finish.\n\nCreated for hair that feels rough, frizzy or difficult to manage, this smoothing shampoo gently cleanses while helping to nourish the hair fibre from the inside out. Powered by Metal Purifier technology and enriched with nourishing ingredients, it helps protect against impurities that can contribute to damage, leaving hair feeling softer, smoother and easier to style.\n\nPerfect for creating a salon-smooth finish, Ultimate Smooth Shampoo helps improve manageability while delivering a silky texture and healthy-looking shine.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nGently cleanses while nourishing dry, unruly hair\n\nHelps smooth the hair surface and reduce frizz\n\nLeaves hair feeling soft, silky and manageable\n\nEnhances shine and a polished finish\n\nHelps protect hair from environmental impurities\n\nHow to use:\n\nApply to wet hair and massage into the scalp and lengths to create a rich lather. Rinse thoroughly and repeat if needed. Follow with Wella Ultimate Smooth Conditioner or Miracle Oil Serum for best results.\n\nIdeal for:\n\nDry, frizzy or coarse hair\n\n🌿 Hair needing softness and smoothness\n\n💫 Anyone wanting a sleek, salon-finished look\n\n🤍 Hair that feels rough, unruly or difficult to manage"}];
